d, Lars H.","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 8","first":"Niels","key":"obelnielspau","last":"Obel","locid":"47b44abc-6c99-4a76-b8b0-ca53b033951b","name":"Obel, Niels","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["39931997"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/jpids/piae126","issn":["20487207"],"issn_org":["20487193"],"issue":"2","journal":"Journal of the Pediatric Infectious Diseases Society","paperid":"piae126","publisher":"Oxford University Press","status":"p","title":"Journal of the Pediatric Infectious Diseases Society","volume":"14"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85217798286"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","North Denmark Region","Other Research","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-c1096c64-8136-437b-a83c-6cb7cd803e7b","au-1e0602b5-521c-407e-8e00-ac1399fef87c","ku-9d3483ec-8273-40ba-95ce-e2ed2354bfd2","sdu-7b03f9fe-fe09-4d08-a751-84d1d3bd46f3"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Neurological Disorders and Use of Healthcare Services After Bacterial Meningitis in Childhood: A Nationwide, Population-Based Cohort Study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-095.00-793021","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"Background: Current guidelines discourage prophylactic plasma use in non-bleeding patients. This study assesses global plasma transfusion practices in the intensive care unit (ICU) and their alignment with current guidelines. Study Design and Methods: This was a sub-study of an international, prospective, observational cohort. Primary outcomes were in-ICU occurrence rate of plasma transfusion, proportion of plasma events of total blood products events, and number of plasma units per event. Secondary outcomes included transfusion indications, INR/PT, and proportion of events for non-bleeding indications. Results: Of 3643 patients included, 356 patients (10%) experienced 547 plasma transfusion events, accounting for 18% of total transfusion events. A median of 2 (IQR 1, 2) units was given per event excluding massive transfusion protocol (MTP) and 3 (IQR 2, 6) when MTP was activated. MTP accounted for 39 (7%) of events. Indications of non-MTP events included active bleeding (54%), prophylactic (25%), and pre-procedure (12%). Target INR/PT was stated for 43% of transfusion events; pre-transfusion INR/PT or visco-elastic hemostatic assays (VHA) were reported for 73%. Thirty-seven percent of events were administered for non-bleeding indications, 54% with a pre-transfusion INR < 3.0 and 30% with an INR < 1.5. Discussion: Plasma transfusions occurred in 10% of ICU patients. Over a third were given for non-bleeding indications and might have been avoidable. Target INR/PT was not stated in more than half of transfusions, and pre-transfusion INR/PT or VHA was not reported for 27%. Further research and education is needed to optimize guideline implementation and to identify appropriate indications for plasma transfusion.","author_count":41,"contributors":["van Haeren, Maite M. T.","Raasveld, Senta Jorinde","de Bruin, Sanne","Reuland, Merijn C.","van den Oord, Claudia","Schenk, Jimmy","Aubron, Cécile","Bakker, Jan","Cecconi, Maurizio","Feldheiser, Aarne","de Grooth, Harm Jan","Meier, Jens","Scheeren, Thomas W. L.","McQuilten, Zoe","Flint, Andrew","Hamid, Tarikul","Piagnerelli, Michaël","Mahečić, Tina Tomić","Benes, Jan","Russell, Lene","Aguirre-Bermeo, Hernan","Triantafyllopoulou, Konstantina","Chantziara, Vasiliki","Gurjar, Mohan","Myatra, Sheila Nainan","Pota, Vincenzo","Elhadi, Muhammed","Gawda, Ryszard","Mourisco, Mafalda","Lance, Marcus","Neskovic, Vojislava","Podbregar, Matej","Llau, Juan V.","Quintana-Diaz, Manual","Cronhjort, Maria","Pfortmueller, Carmen A.","Yapici, Nihan","Nielsen, Nathan D.","Shah, Akshay","Vlaar, Alexander P. J.","Müller, Marcella C. A."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-800374"],"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Africa","America, North","America, South","Asia, Middle East","Asia, South","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"corpau":["InPUT Study Group"],"country":["Australia","Austria","Bangladesh","Belgium","Chile","Croatia","Czechia","Ecuador","France","Germany","Greece","India","Italy","Kenya","Libya","Netherlands","Poland","Portugal","Serbia","Slovenia","Spain","Sweden","Switzerland","Turkey","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["Aga Khan University Hospital","All Global Affiliations","Amsterdam UMC","Asgar Ali Hospital","CHU de Charleroi","Centro Hospitalar de Entro o Douro e Vouga","Charles University","Erasmus University Rotterdam","European Interbalkan Medical Center","Hospital Universitario Dr. Peset","Hospital Universitario La Paz","Hospital Vicente Corral Moscoso","IRCCS Istituto Clinico Humanitas - Rozzano (Milano)","Johannes Kepler University Linz","Karolinska Institutet","Kliniken Essen-Mitte","Military Medical Academy","Monash University","National and Kapodistrian University of Athens","Pontificia Universidad Católica de Chile","Sanjay Gandhi Postgraduate Institute of Medical Sciences","Tata Memorial Hospital","University Hospital Bern","University of Amsterdam","University of Bern",