,"orcid":"0000-0001-7352-8728","rank":39,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"9","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"alstrømhenrikpau","last":"Alstrøm","name":"Alstrøm, Henrik","rank":40,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"9","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"hestadsørenpau","last":"Hestad","name":"Hestad, Søren","rank":41,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"9","corresponding":null,"first":"Tanja Hesse","key":"fogtmanntanjahessepau","last":"Fogtmann","name":"Fogtmann, Tanja Hesse","rank":42,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Ulrik","key":"hovebuciekjensulrikpau","last":"Hove Buciek","name":"Hove Buciek, Jens Ulrik","rank":43,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Karina","key":"jakobsenkarinapau","last":"Jakobsen","name":"Jakobsen, Karina","rank":44,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"9 8","first":"Mette","key":"kragmettepau","last":"Krag","locid":"de08c219-be19-41c9-94b6-474ec53a7a46","name":"Krag, Mette","rank":45,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael","key":"sandgaardmichaelpau","last":"Sandgaard","name":"Sandgaard, Michael","rank":46,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Birthe","key":"sindbergbirthepau","last":"Sindberg","locid":"c7f06172-912f-4899-9a3a-9bab67f5c148","name":"Sindberg, Birthe","orcid":"0000-0002-2257-377X","rank":47,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars W","key":"andersenlarswpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"07a36c36-5826-434f-b882-d8cb9fec6fb0","name":"Andersen, Lars W","orcid":"0000-0001-5752-8082","rank":48,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["40348355"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.resuscitation.2025.110634","issn":["03009572","18731570"],"issn_org":["03009572"],"journal":"Resuscitation","paperid":"110634","publisher":"Elsevier Ireland Ltd","status":"p","title":"Resuscitation","volume":"212"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-105005228141"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Other Hospitals","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark","prehospital emergency medical services"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e68c8f10-9ad1-4a01-81de-4b51369bfa46","au-fa2050a7-514f-4a11-addf-730b6ac997fa","ku-27f32f4c-65d5-48ad-803c-0a6d145e6b9e","sdu-3d826c1e-e5ba-45a1-82b6-7444dcfa4c2d"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Intraosseous vs. Intravenous Access during Out-of-hospital Cardiac Arrest : A Bayesian Secondary Analysis of a Randomised Clinical Trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-099.92-813490","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"In the field of information technology, cybersecurity and privacy are critical concepts. The importance of privacy, ethics, and social media awareness education has grown in recent years because of the widespread use of social media platforms such as Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, and LinkedIn. It becomes crucial that more people from both technical and non-technical backgrounds must enter the field of cybersecurity to address future challenges. In this paper, we study how to incorporate concepts like privacy, ethics, and social media use into Capture the Flag (CTF) challenges/tasks to make cybersecurity interesting and appealing to a wider audience covering technical savvy and technical non-savvy people. The workshops have been conducted in Danish high schools, which is the foundation of how students have been separated into technical and non-technical students. This has allowed for the investigation of both students’ and teachers’ reactions to exercises that integrated non-technical concepts into cybersecurity training. The study has been done by observing how students interact with both the platform and the exercises, online questionnaires, and short interviews with teachers and students during the workshops. According to the findings, participants from a variety of educational backgrounds found broader cybersecurity concepts appealing and interesting. Furthermore, participant feedback is used to create new CTF challenges.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Saddiqa, Mubashrah","Larsen, Kristian Helmer Kjær","Nielsen, Robert Nedergaard","Sørensen, Lene Tolstrup","Pedersen, Jens Myrup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-698885"],"event":{"end":"2023-07-04","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2023-07-03","title":"International Conference on Cybersecurity, Situational Awareness and Social Media, CYBER SCIENCE 2023","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2023-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Saddiqa, Mubashrah"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"privacy and security training platform for a diverse audience","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-698885","identifier":[{"id":"85187769756","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-b139fa6d-52d4-439b-8f26-5ab0a6205783"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4105A4C89E5F7BE13A0FAF1CDAE995EA"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Center for Communication, Media and Information Technologies","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Cyber Security Group","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Humans and Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mubashrah","key":"saddiqapau","last":"Saddiqa","locid":"a6ae3477-82e9-487a-b9bf-c390ce039c6c","name":"Saddiqa, Mubashrah","orcid":"0000-0002-4816-2426","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kristian Helmer Kjær","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"40ab70ae-f5c2-4eec-af01-b33b3c57993c","name":"Larsen, Kristian Helmer Kjær","orcid":"0009-0003-7996-5429","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"