{"abstract":"When the article was published, the Result-section of the Abstract was given in a misleading wording. Instead of “Absence of acquired immune deficiency syndrome (AIDS), non-cancer-related immune deficiency, liver failure, male sex, septic shock, and bleeding at ICU admission were associated with the development of thrombocytopenia during ICU stay”. it should read “Non-AIDS-, non-cancer-related immune deficiency, liver failure, male sex, septic shock, and bleeding at ICU admission were associated with the development of thrombocytopenia during ICU stay.” The Original publication has been corrected.","author_count":50,"contributors":["Anthon, Carl Thomas","Pène, Frédéric","Perner, Anders","Azoulay, Elie","Puxty, Kathryn","Van De Louw, Andry","Barratt-Due, Andreas","Chawla, Sanjay","Castro, Pedro","Póvoa, Pedro","Coelho, Luis","Metaxa, Victoria","Kochanek, Matthias","Liebregts, Tobias","Kander, Thomas","Hästbacka, Johanna","Andreasen, Jo Bønding","Péju, Edwige","Nielsen, Lene Bjerregaard","Hvas, Christine Lodberg","Dufranc, Etienne","Canet, Emmanuel","Lundqvist, Linda","Wright, Christopher John","Schmidt, Julien","Uhel, Fabrice","Ait-Oufella, Hafid","Krag, Mette","Cos Badia, Elisabet","Díaz-Lagares, Cándido","Menat, Sophie","Voiriot, Guillaume","Clausen, Niels Erikstrup","Lorentzen, Kristian","Kvåle, Reidar","Hildebrandt, Thomas","Holten, Aleksander Rygh","Strand, Kristian","Tzalavras, Asterios","Bestle, Morten Heiberg","Klepstad, Pål","Fernandez, Sara","Vimpere, Damien","Paulino, Carolina","Graça, Carina","Lueck, Catherina","Juhl, Christian Svendsen","Costa, Carolina","Bådstøløkken, Per Martin","Miranda, Teresa"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-722902"],"filters":{"added":"2024-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corpau":["the PLOT-ICU Collaborators and the Nine-I Study Group"],"country":["Finland","Germany","Netherlands","Norway","Portugal","Spain","Sweden","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["Akershus University Hospital","All Global Affiliations","Department of Intensive Care Adults","Essen University Hospital","Hannover Medical School","Haukeland University Hospital","Helsinki University Hospital","Hospital General Granollers","King's College London","Memorial Sloan-Kettering Cancer Center","NOVA University Lisbon","Oslo University Hospital","San Francisco Xavier Hospital","Skåne University Hospital","St. Olav University Hospital","Stavanger University hospital","The Pennsylvania State University","University of Barcelona","University of Cologne","Vall d'Hebron University Hospital","the Queen Elisabeth University Hospital"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"OT":["Médecine Intensive and Réanimation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"correction thrombocytopenia and platelet transfusions in icu patients an international inception cohort study plot icu","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00134-023-07291-6","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-722902","identifier":[{"id":"85179316866","type":"scopus"},{"id":"38078947","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC10810924","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["sdu-0fbab823-50d1-4114-9ed9-0c6973e013ea"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-985A3DE8EB02D9312FDFF6A8589F5287"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00134-023-07291-6","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/