f Southern Denmark","VIA University College"],"title":"Delirium and Delirium Severity Screening in the Intensive Care : Correspondence of Screenings Tools","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-096.89-735252","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Mosaic chromosomal alterations (mCAs) in hematopoietic cells increase mortality and risk of hematological cancers and infections. We investigated the landscape of mCAs and their clinical consequences in 976 patients with multiple myeloma undergoing high-dose chemotherapy and autologous stem cell support (ASCT) with median 6.4 years of follow-up. mCAs were detected in the stem cell harvest product of 158 patients (16.2%). Autosomal aberrations were found in 60 patients (6.1%) and affected all chromosomes. Loss of chromosome X was found in 51 females (12.7%) and loss of chromosome Y in 55 males (9.6%). Overall survival and progression were similar between carriers of autosomal mCAs and non-carriers. In contrast, female patients with loss of the X chromosome had longer overall survival (age-adjusted[a.a.] HR 0.54, 95% CI 0.32–0.93, p = 0.02), lower risk of progression (a.a. HR 0.55, 95% CI 0.35–0.87; p = 0.01), and better post-transplant response (higher degree of complete response (CR) or very good partial response (VGPR)). The reason for this substantial effect is unknown. Additionally, myeloma clones in the stem cell product was confirmed by mCA analysis in the few patients with multiple mCAs (n = 12 patients). Multiple mCAs conferred inferior overall survival (a.a. HR 2.0, 95% CI 1.02–3.84; p = 0.04) and higher risk of myeloma progression (a.a. HR 3.36, 95% CI 1.67–6.81; p < 0.001), which is presumed to be driven by suspected myeloma contaminants.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Husby, Simon","Tulstrup, Morten","Harsløf, Mads","Nielsen, Christian","Haastrup, Eva","Ebbesen, Lene Hyldahl","Klarskov Andersen, Mette","Pertesi, Maroulio","Brieghel, Christian","Niemann, Carsten U.","Nilsson, Björn","Szabo, Agoston Gyula","Andersen, Niels Frost","Abildgaard, Niels","Vangsted, Annette","Grønbæk, Kirsten"],"cuid":["S03-100.00-793309"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Husby, Simon"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Lund University"],"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Chromosome Aberrations","Female","Follow Up Studies","Hematopoietic Stem Cell Transplantation methods","Hematopoietic Stem Cells metabolism","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Mosaicism","Multiple Myeloma genetics","Prognosis","Transplantation Autologous","Treatment Outcome"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mosaic chromosomal alterations in hematopoietic cells and clinical outcomes in patients with multiple myeloma","src":["au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41375-024-02396-3","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S03-100.00-793309","identifier":[{"id":"PMC11518982","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85202925673","type":"scopus"},{"id":"39223296","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-75f3010e-e457-48c9-a24d-880db297ca46","ku-6e8965fc-7745-4107-afaa-611b07c7b920","sdu-0fe20f1c-2c9e-4bc0-b6f1-6998afb73a06"],"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Chromosome Aberrations","Female","Follow-Up Studies","Hematopoietic Stem Cell Transplantation/methods","Hematopoietic Stem Cells/metabolism","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Mosaicism","Multiple Myeloma/genetics","Prognosis","Transplantation, Autologous","Treatment Outcome"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-48086D8036C2244180D30F9C95305B3F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/283257945/s41375-024-02396-