","corresponding":null,"first":"Robin","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"04bf2bf9-a6d8-4be8-93fd-82f3f2ddc9ba","name":"Christensen, Robin","orcid":"0000-0002-6600-0631","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens","key":"kjeldsenpau","last":"Kjeldsen","locid":"4893b496-ebc1-4498-92aa-836500b4cb45","name":"Kjeldsen, Jens","orcid":"0000-0001-8148-6572","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38754881"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1136/bmjopen-2023-083144","issn":["20446055"],"issue":"5","journal":"BMJ Open","paperid":"e083144","publisher":"BMJ Publishing Group","status":"p","title":"BMJ Open","volume":"14"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85193451368"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Private Research","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Nordic Bioscience","Private Research","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-c6e3032e-760c-4410-b5fd-fc3ca8f5e81c"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Novel biomarker profiles to improve individual diagnosis and prognosis in patients with suspected inflammatory bowel disease : protocol for the Nordic inception cohort study (NORDTREAT)","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-750933","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"The intestinal epithelium ensures uptake of vital nutrients and acts as a barrier between luminal contents and the underlying immune system. In inflammatory bowel diseases, such as ulcerative colitis (UC), this barrier is compromised, and patients experience debilitating symptoms. Here, we perform single-cell RNA profiling of epithelial cells and outline patterns of cell fate decisions in healthy individuals and UC patients. We demonstrate that patterns of hierarchical behavior are altered in UC patients and identify unique cellular states associated with Janus kinase/signal transducer and activator of transcription (JAK/STAT) activation in ulcerated and non-ulcerated areas of the colonic epithelium. These transcriptional changes could be recapitulated in human colonic organoids, wherein cytokine-mediated activation of JAK/STAT led to the emergence of cell populations with augmented regenerative properties. Altogether, our findings indicate that intricate relationships between epithelial and cytokine signaling regulate cell fate during epithelial tissue regeneration in humans and have important implications for the understanding of UC biology.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Maciag, Grzegorz","Hansen, Stine Lind","Krizic, Kata","Kellermann, Lauge","Zøylner, Maureen Joy Inventor","Ulyanchenko, Svetlana","Maimets, Martti","Baattrup, Astrid Moeller","Riis, Lene Buhl","Khodosevich, Konstantin","Sato, Toshiro","Bressan, Raul Bardini","Nielsen, Ole Haagen","Jensen, Kim B"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-759578"],"filters":{"added":"2024-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","OECD"],"country":["Japan"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Keio University"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"jak stat signaling promotes the emergence of unique cell states in ulcerative colitis","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.stemcr.2024.06.006","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-759578","identifier":[{"id":"85200314653","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC11368673","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"39029458","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-0bc6b143-3d21-4477-965e-abf67038fc7d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CE9DDB0F16B7C0B9790E99292A017DE2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.stemcr.2024.06.006","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/403269092/1_s2.0_S2213671124001863_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Dept. of Biomedical Sciences, reNEW, Jensen Lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Herlev and Gentofte"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"jp","key":"keio university","loc":["Japan","Asia, East","OECD"],"name":"Keio University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Grzegorz","key":"maciagpau","last":"Maciag","locid":"eb43581f-dafd-4099-becc-b9ff8a77c118","name":"Maciag, Grze