{"abstract":"The interplay between the immune system, coagulation, and endothelium is critical in regulating the host response to infection. However, in sepsis and other critical illnesses, a dysregulated immune response can lead to excessive alterations in these mechanisms, resulting in coagulopathy, endothelial dysfunction, and multi-organ dysfunction. This review aims to provide a comprehensive analysis of the pathophysiological mechanisms that govern the complex interplay between immune dysfunction, endothelial dysfunction, and coagulation in sepsis. It emphasises clinical significance, evaluation methods, and potential therapeutic interventions. Understanding these mechanisms is essential for developing effective treatments that can modulate the immune response, mitigate thrombosis, restore endothelial function, and ultimately improve patient survival.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Girardis, Massimo","David, Sascha","Ferrer, Ricard","Helms, Julie","Juffermans, Nicole P.","Martin-Loeches, Ignacio","Povoa, Pedro","Russell, Lene","Shankar-Hari, Manu","Iba, Toshiaki","Coloretti, Irene","Parchim, Nicholas","Nielsen, Nathan D."],"cuid":["S02-083.65-769238"],"filters":{"added":"2024-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Girardis, Massimo"],"country":["France","Ireland","Italy","Japan","Netherlands","Portugal","Spain","Switzerland","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Erasmus University Medical Center Rotterdam","Erasmus University Rotterdam","Hospital São José","Juntendo University","Juntendo University Graduate School of Medicine","NOVA University Lisbon","Royal Infirmary of Edinburgh","San Francisco Xavier Hospital","St James’s University Hospital","St. James's Hospital","The University of Edinburgh","University Hospital Zurich","University Hospital Zürich","University of Barcelona","University of Edinburgh","University of Modena and Reggio Emilia","University of New Mexico","University of Strasbourg","Vall d'Hebron Institut de Recerca","Vall d'Hebron University Hospital"],"keyword":["Blood Coagulation Disorders etiology","Coagulation","Endothelium","Endothelium Vascular physiopathology","Hemostasis physiology","Humans","Immune system","Sepsis","Sepsis physiopathology"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"understanding assessing and treating immune endothelial and haemostasis dysfunctions in bacterial sepsis","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85202949817","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-083.65-769238","identifier":[{"id":"85202949817","type":"scopus"},{"id":"39222142","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-cc0c5391-96bb-4af4-b168-1b2fe3d2c5fd","sdu-4dbd51bd-1eaf-42d9-bb63-54f2e8fde8b7"],"keyword":["Blood Coagulation Disorders/etiology","Coagulation","Endothelium","Endothelium, Vascular/physiopathology","Hemostasis/physiology","Humans","Immune system","Multiple Organ Failure/physiopathology","Sepsis","Sepsis/physiopathology"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-13DFEA1AB718ADDF49CA11EC8A5688FF"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"it","key":"university of modena and reggio emilia","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Modena and Reggio Emilia","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"ch","key":"university hospital zürich","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University Hospital Zürich","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"ch","key":"university hospit