{"abstract":"I et modsvar til tre forskere skrev boligselskabet AKB København, at den almene boligsektor ikke kan bære den sociale byrde for landets mest udsatte borgere alene. Men det skal den heller ikke, men den har et medansvar, skriver de tre forskere i en replik.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Rikke Skovgaard","Nordberg, Lene Wiell","Andersen, Hans Thor"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-742564"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Almene boliger","Boligpolitik","Social ulighed","Udsatte borgere"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"forskere til alment boligselskab i skal ikke bære den sociale byrde for de svageste alene men i løfter et vigtigt ansvar","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/by/artikel/forskere-til-alment-boligselskab-i-skal-ikke-baere-den-sociale-byrde-for-de-svageste-alene-men-i-loefter-et-vigtigt-ansvar?toke=8c6d762edad644d584e5d81e6f0e3bf5","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-742564","ids":["aau-132aa29b-0545-4794-8066-334ffb9b229a"],"keyword":["Almene boliger","Boligpolitik","Social ulighed","Udsatte borgere"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-07E3803764566D97D4848B7257DBE4D0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/by/artikel/forskere-til-alment-boligselskab-i-skal-ikke-baere-den-sociale-byrde-for-de-svageste-alene-men-i-loefter-et-vigtigt-ansvar?toke=8c6d762edad644d584e5d81e6f0e3bf5","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Town, Housing and Property","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Transformation of Housing and Places Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rikke Skovgaard","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"125da2cb-a5a5-47e8-84ab-be518f10a19f","name":"Nielsen, Rikke Skovgaard","orcid":"0000-0003-0308-1275","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene Wiell","key":"nordbergpau","last":"Nordberg","locid":"4620ca55-6074-4b3d-98ed-0321710187b8","name":"Nordberg, Lene Wiell","orcid":"0000-0003-3344-0574","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans Thor","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"3e5ea6c9-85ba-4f6f-a9ce-59d5383c7db3","name":"Andersen, Hans Thor","orcid":"0000-0002-0684-4701","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"newspaper":"Altinget - By og Bolig","status":"p","title":"Altinget - By og Bolig"},"review":"Undetermined","sdg":["10. Reduced Inequalities","11. Sustainable Cities and Production","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-132aa29b-0545-4794-8066-334ffb9b229a"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Forskere til alment boligselskab : I skal ikke bære den sociale byrde for de svageste alene, men I løfter et vigtigt ansvar","type":"Newspaper Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-742564","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
