":"Mocroft, Amanda","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Matthew","key":"lawpau","last":"Law","name":"Law, Matthew","rank":23,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"18 23","first":"Lene","key":"ryompau","last":"Ryom","locid":"0087fd9d-3a4d-4da5-9f4d-2ba51ec7d7a8","name":"Nielsen, Lene Ryom","name_org":"Ryom, Lene","rank":24,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Kathy","key":"petoumenospau","last":"Petoumenos","name":"Petoumenos, Kathy","rank":25,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38621392"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/s2352-3018(23)00328-4","issn":["23523018"],"issue":"5","journal":"The Lancet HIV","status":"p","title":"The Lancet HIV","volume":"11"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85191325949"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-5480747a-57ec-4a55-a98a-3bac4279bb14"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Associations between change in BMI and the risk of hypertension and dyslipidaemia in people receiving integrase strand-transfer inhibitors, tenofovir alafenamide, or both compared with other contemporary antiretroviral regimens : a multicentre, prospective observational study from the RESPOND consortium cohorts","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-809762","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"A Day In Life is a collective methodological experiment in the Nordic Research Network: Young People, Belonging and Exclusion. Since 2013, the research net- work has brought together Nordic youth researchers in creative workshops and has published two scientific anthologies (Wulf-Andersen, Follesø & Olsen 2016; 2021). The experiment builds on these works, with the ambition of reopening questions and insights about young people’s lives, belonging and exclusion. In 2022, 13 researchers followed 13 young persons (16-20 years) one day somewhere in the Nordic countries. The framework for the experiment was formulated in a common set of dogmas with the ambition of exploring the potentials of one day of collaborative fieldwork and dialogue with one young person, and the potentials of/methods for collective analysis and synthesis. What can be learned about current youth research, if we use this collective experiment to shed light on research practices, which are often individual(ized)? We present methodological reflections from the experiment: What happens, when each researcher, in negotiation with a specific young person in a local context, plans the day and operationalizes the dogmas? What happens when we zoom in on and immerse ourselves in activities, movements, and spaces of one day, rather than focusing research by way of well-defined research questions or by stretching fieldwork over long-term periods? The non-traditional approach raises critical questions about research methodology, ethics and conditions, which can contribute to the development of a collaborative, just and fair youth research.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Wulf-Andersen, Trine Østergaard","Follesø, Reidun","Larsen, Lene","Schellerup Nielsen, Helle","Halås, Catrine","Mogensen, Kevin Holger","Gravesen, David Thore","Olsen, Terje"],"cuid":["S02-083.32-785409"],"event":{"end":"2024-06-14","place":"Tampere, fi","start":"2024-06-12","title":"NYRIS 2024 - Nordic Youth Research Symposium","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","FAFO","Fafo Institutt for arbeidslivs- og velferdsforskning","Højskolen i Sørøst, Norge","Nord Universitet","Universitetet i Nordland","University of South-Eastern Norway"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a day in life a collective research experiment","src":["kp","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC","DI-UC-KP"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-083.32-785409","ids":["kp-dec1b996-b025-427d-b471-aa376558f8f6","ruc-129d5f82-9619-4650-a0e8-dd4218c29d8a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-2-7D879FAD3BA46F4DC621AC125B0F6716"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Learning, Education and Pedagogy (LEAP)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Rektors område, Fakultet for pædagogiske og samfundsfaglige uddannelser-Dekan, Socialrådgiveruddannelsen 4"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"no","key":"university of south eastern norway","loc":["Norway","Eur