{"abstract":"Når en række aktører på erhvervsuddannelsesområdet efterspørger forskere, handler misforståelsen måske om, at man kun ser mod skolerne. Men en væsentlig og betydningsfuld del af et forløb på en erhvervsuddannelse er netop praktikopholdene, skriver Lene Tanggaard og Klaus Nielsen.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Tanggaard, Lene","Nielsen, Klaus"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-056907"],"filters":{"added":"2023-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"professorer der søges med lys og lygte efter erhvervsuddannelsesforskere men vi er jo lige her","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/artikel/professorer-i-efterspoerger-forskere-i-erhvervsuddannelser-her-er-vi","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-056907","ids":["aau-1759ede2-6c17-45b1-a6f2-3a06c2517fb4"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-4BA4D7FBF42235ED43BECE3157345EC8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/artikel/professorer-i-efterspoerger-forskere-i-erhvervsuddannelser-her-er-vi","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of C