{"abstract":"The cooperative model is known for its resilience and objective that prioritizes the common needs of their members, rather than returns for shareholders. The governance model follows a value-driven logic and a democratic structure, in that decision making is based on the “one person - one vote” principle. Under this umbrella, employee-owned businesses (EOBs) are organizations where the employees own and manage the company. Like other types of cooperatives, they arevalue driven, member owned, and democratically controlled organizations; principles that explain why EOBs have been economically sound and more resilient to crisis, such as Covid, compared to other types of organizations.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nicolajsen, Hanne Westh","Baka, Vasiliki","Nielsen, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-718937"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Cooperative","Cooperative governance","Digital era","employee owned businesses"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"enacting cooperative governance in the digital era","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-718937","ids":["itu-fd496beb-db0f-4958-93f1-7e992332a335"],"keyword":["Cooperative","cooperative governance","digital era","employee-owned businesses"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-1D4A7CC146CC675D0349F2C2DE0EE63D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Digitalization, Democracy, and Governance, REFLACT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne Westh","key":"nicolajsenpau","last":"Nicolajsen","locid":"54728da8-274d-40e6-b119-23318d995721","name":"Nicolajsen, Hanne Westh","orcid":"0000-0002-0158-5034","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vasiliki","key":"bakapau","last":"Baka","locid":"4e33d926-364b-47b8-97d7-409c16b62db9","name":"Baka, Vasiliki","orcid":"0000-0001-7738-7846","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"1052b289-f510-4c5a-9662-2db48c12ebc2","name":"Nielsen, Lene","orcid":"0000-0003-1768-7147","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-fd496beb-db0f-4958-93f1-7e992332a335"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Enacting cooperative governance in the digital era","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-718937","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"During the last century, several forest calamities has been caused by host shifts where an introduced fungus has become a severe pathogen on a native species that lacked co-evolutionary history with the new pathogen. This is considered to be the case for the European ash (Fraxinus excelsior) that in recent decades has become severely damaged throughout most of its natural distribution area by the introduced Asian ascomycete Hymenoscyphus fraxineus. Fortunately, genetic variation in resistance against the novel pathogen in Europe was identified early in the epidemic, and a substantial body of research has since focused on understanding the genetics of this resistance with the vision to promote resilience of ash forest based on wise genetic management practices. Here, we review knowledge obtained from common garden trials, inoculation tests, in situ field studies of mature ash forests, analysis of microbiomes, genomes, transcriptomes and analysis in relation to survival and reproductive fitness. Based on present the knowledge, we discuss how genetic considerations can be integrated into the management of natural and planted ash forests to enhance and protect their resistance and evolutionary resilience.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Kjær, Erik Dahl","Lobo, Albin","Kosawang, Chatchai","Long, Feng","Thomsen, Iben Margrete","Doonan, James","Xu, Jing","Hansen, Lars","Nielsen, Lene Rostgaard","Hansen, Jon Kehlet"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-720239"],"event":{"end":"2023-09-15","place":"Brasov, ro","start":"2023-09-12","title":"EvolTree Conference 2023","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"resilience of european ash forests influenced by ash dieback","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.31926/evoltree.2023","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-720239","ids":["ku-5213ffd5-5317-4329-897f-0aec5d90637b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3A4C8CEFC3B7DCBA7E2EDA12DFF8A322"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.31926/evoltree.2023","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.evoltree.eu/fileadmin/Websites/Evoltree/Uploads/Documents/Events/EvolTree_BoA_07.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/376960664/Resilient_Forests_for_the_Future_European_ash_forests.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Geosciences and Natural Resource Management, Forest and Landscape Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Erik Dahl","key":"kjærerikdahlpau","last":"Kjær","locid":"e1bdaffb-0384-4159-aa20-a913a2cee948","name":"Kjær, Erik Dahl","orcid":"0000-0001-8624-1611","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Albin","key":"loboalbinpau","last":"Lobo","locid":"50b0d4fe-6e8d-4245-aded-c406110ff0b0","name":"Lobo, Albin","orcid":"0000-0002-9580-2860","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Chatchai","key":"kosawangchatchaipau","last":"Kosawang","locid":"1b69b056-6473-427b-81f9-20fbd6797849","name":"Kosawang, Chatchai","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Feng","key":"longfengpau","last":"Long","locid":"88bae5d7-47cc-4beb-b49b-44d82659b5f1","name":"Long, Feng","orcid":"0000-0001-8895-2193","rank":4,