","name":"Christensen, Lene Svendstrup","name_org":"Svendstrup, Lene","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6 7","corresponding":null,"first":"Ulrik","key":"hintzepau","last":"Hintze","locid":"08ea7307-dac0-4ad9-b96c-b6b1ea53cf2f","name":"Hintze, Ulrik","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"8","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole Dyg","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Ole Dyg","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Ulla","key":"davidsenpau","last":"Davidsen","name":"Davidsen, Ulla","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6 7","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"fischerpau","last":"Fischer","locid":"5c315905-985f-4473-aed7-5ec093debce3","name":"Fischer, Thomas","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6 7","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Brock","key":"johansenpau","last":"Johansen","locid":"e57328b2-dec3-44f9-803f-e9579340a1f5","name":"Johansen, Jens Brock","orcid":"0000-0001-7157-7948","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","name":"Kristensen, Jens","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian","key":"gerdespau","last":"Gerdes","locid":"43704ceb-b5ba-49ac-bff8-5e26e3b9d419","name":"Gerdes, Christian","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Cosedis","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"cc1c8be7-f54a-4722-8077-aa358f9b090a","name":"Nielsen, Jens Cosedis","orcid":"0000-0001-9414-1653","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["37638973"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/eurheartj/ehad564","issn":["0195668X","15229645"],"issn_org":["0195668X"],"issue":"40","journal":"European Heart Journal","pages":"4246-4255","paperid":"ehad564","publisher":"Oxford University Press","status":"p","title":"European Heart Journal","volume":"44"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85176296434"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-5e3e2f41-351a-4b2e-b580-b6a42bd4d01a","au-78405aa5-409a-4d4f-bd34-701599efe23e","sdu-e67917ef-ca0a-46fa-a782-40ea0f43f13a"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Atrial pacing minimization in sinus node dysfunction and risk of incident atrial fibrillation: a randomized trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-099.32-697716","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Objectives: To develop an Outcome Measures in Rheumatology (OMERACT) ultrasonography score for monitoring disease activity in giant cell arteritis (GCA) and evaluate its metric properties. Methods: The OMERACT Instrument Selection Algorithm was followed. Forty-nine members of the OMERACT ultrasonography large vessel vasculitis working group were invited to seven Delphi rounds. An online reliability exercise was conducted using images of bilateral common temporal arteries, parietal and frontal branches as well as axillary arteries from 16 patients with GCA and 7 controls. Sensitivity to change and convergent construct validity were tested using data from a prospective cohort of patients with new GCA in which ultrasound-based intima-media thickness (IMT) measurements were conducted at weeks 1, 3, 6, 12 and 24. Results: Agreement was obtained (92.7%) for the OMERACT GCA Ultrasonography Score (OGUS), calculated as follows: sum of IMT measured in every segment divided by the rounded cut-off values of IMTs in each segment. The resulting value is then divided by the number of segments available. Thirty-five members conducted the reliability exercise, the interrater intraclass correlation coefficient (ICC) for the OGUS was 0.72-0.84 and the median intrareader ICC was 0.91. The prospective cohort consisted of 52 patients. Sensitivity to change between baseline and each follow-up visit up to week 24 yielded standardised mean differences from-1.19 to-2.16, corresponding to large and very large magnitudes of change, respectively. OGUS correlated moderately with erythrocyte sedimentation rate, C reactive protein and Birmingham Vasculitis Activity Score (corrcoeff 0.37-0.48). Conclusion: We developed a provisional OGUS for potential use in clinical trials.","author_count":53,"contributors":["Dejaco, Christian","Ponte, Cristina","Monti, Sara","Rozza, Davide","Scirè, Carlo Alberto","Terslev, Lene","Bruyn, George A.W.","Boumans, Dennis","Hartung, Wolfgang","Hočevar, Alojzija","Milchert, Marcin","Døhn, Uffe Møller","Mukhtyar, Chetan B.","Aschwanden, Markus","Bosch, Philipp","Camellino, Dario","Chrysidis, Stavros","Ciancio, Giovanni","D'Agostino, Maria Antonietta","Daikeler, Thomas","Dasgupta, Bhaskar","De Miguel, Eugenio","Diamantopoulos, Andreas P.","Duftner, Christina","Agueda, Ana","Fredberg, Ulrich","Hanova, Petra","Hansen, Ib Tønder","Hauge, Ellen Margrethe","Iagnocco, Annamaria","Inanc, Nevsun","Juche, Aaron","Karalilova, Rositsa","Kawamoto, Toshio","Keller, Kresten Krarup","Keen, Helen Isobel","Kermani, Tanaz A.","Kohler, Minna J.","Koster, Matthew","Luqmani, Raashid Ahmed","MacChioni, Pierluigi","MacKie, Sarah Louise","Naredo, Esperanza","Nielsen, Berit Dalsgaard","Ogasawara, Michihiro","Pineda, Carlos","Schäfer, Valentin Sebastian","Seitz, Luca","Tomelleri, Alessandro","Torralba, Karina D.","Van Der Geest, Kornelis S.M.","Warrington, Kenneth J.","Schmidt, Wolfgang A."],"cuid":["S03-100.00-672838"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["America, Central","America, North","Asia, East","Asia, Middle East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"corresponding_author":["Dejaco, Christian"],"country":["Australia","Austria","Bulgaria","Czechia","France","Germany","Italy","Japan","Mexico","Netherlands","Norway","Poland","Portugal","Slovenia","Spain","Switzerland","Turkey","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["Akershus University Hospital","All Global Affiliations","Asklepios Medical Center","Azienda Ospedaliera Santa Maria Nuova di Reggio Emilia","Brunico Hospital","Centro Hospitalar do Baixo Vouga","Centro Hospitalar do Baixo Vouga EPE","Division of Rheumatology","Fondazione Policlinico Universitario Agostino Gemelli IRCCS","Fondazione Policlinico Universitario Gemelli","Foundation IRSCCS Polyclinic San Matteo","French National Institute of Health","Harvard Medical School","Harvard University","Hospital Grou