"University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-584ed712-5b37-4f61-a8f5-6b6c0a24afd6","ku-ea8cd57c-d9a3-40c7-8344-1e285f8f7215"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Autonomous Chest Radiograph Reporting Using AI : Estimation of Clinical Impact","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.96-685926","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Polyautoimmunity is defined as having 2 or more autoimmune diseases. Little is known about polyautoimmunity in patients with cutaneous lupus erythematosus (CLE). OBJECTIVES: To estimate prevalence and 5-year incidence of non-lupus erythematosus (LE) autoimmune diseases in patients with CLE. METHODS: Patients with CLE were identified In the Danish National Patient Registry and each patient was age- and sex-matched with 10 general population controls. Outcome information on non-LE autoimmune diseases was obtained by register-linkage between Danish National Patient Registry and the National Prescription Register. The risk ratio (RR) for prevalent non-LE autoimmune disease at time of CLE diagnosis was calculated in modified Poisson regression; and hazard ratios (HRs) for incident non-LE autoimmune disease were estimated in Cox regression analyses. RESULTS: Overall, 1674 patients with CLE had a higher prevalence of a non-LE autoimmune disease than the comparators (18.5 vs 7.9%; RR 2.4; 95% CI, 2.1 to 2.6). Correspondingly, the cumulative incidence of a non-LE autoimmune disease during 5 years of follow-up was increased for the patients with CLE: HR 3.5 (95% CI, 3.0 to 4.0). LIMITATIONS: Risk of detection and misclassification bias, mainly pertaining to the CLE group. CONCLUSION: Patients with CLE had higher prevalence and 5-year cumulative incidence of a non-LE autoimmune disease than the general population.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Graven-Nielsen, Christoffer S.","Vestergaard Vittrup, I.","Kragh, Anna J.","Lund, Fredrik","Bliddal, Sofie","Kofoed, Kristian","Kristensen, Salome","Stensballe, Allan","Nielsen, Claus H.","Feldt-Rasmussen, Ulla","Cordtz, René","Dreyer, Lene"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-715594"],"filters":{"added":"2023-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Graven-Nielsen, Christoffer S."],"keyword":["Autoimmune Diseases","Cutaneous lupus erythematosus","Epidemiology","polyautoimmunity","thyroid autoimmunity"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR"],"OT":["Skin Clinic Rødovre"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"polyautoimmunity in patients with cutaneous lupus erythematosus a nationwide sex and age matched cohort study from denmark","src":["aau","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jdin.2023.07.018","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Funding sources: Dr Feldt-Rasmussen’s research salary is funded by a grant from Kirsten and Freddy Johansen’s Fund. Funding sources: Dr Feldt-Rasmussen's research salary is funded by a grant from Kirsten and Freddy Johansen's Fund."],"id":"S02-100.00-715594","identifier":[{"id":"PMC10550802","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"37808964","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85172086414","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-18eaf685-458b-4356-8db8-b94fac998670","ku-42625130-07bf-4dc5-9429-464d9e13230c"],"keyword":["autoimmune diseases","cutaneous lupus erythematosus","epidemiology","polyautoimmunity","thyroid autoimmunity"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-D5B3659D3405F6374B65D0862A914535"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/552829759/1-s2.0-S2666328723001360-main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/379034896/Fulltext.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jdin.2023.07.018","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","