{"abstract":"Intensive care unit (ICU) patients with Coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) have an increased risk of thromboembolic complications. We describe the occurrence of thromboembolic and bleeding events in all ICU patients with COVID-19 in Denmark during the first and second waves of the pandemic","author_count":29,"contributors":["Russell, Lene","Weihe, Sarah","Madsen, Emilie Kabel","Hvas, Christine Lodberg","Leistner, Jens Wolfgang","Michelsen, Jens","Brøchner, Anne Craveiro","Bastiansen, Anders","Mølgaard Nielsen, Frederik","Meier, Nick","Andreasen, Anne Sofie","Ribergaard, Niels‐Erik","Rasmussen, Bodil Steen","Sølling, Christoffer Grant","Buck, David Levarett","Bundgaard, Helle","Pedersen, Helle Scharling","Darfelt, Iben Strøm","Poulsen, Lone Musaeus","Ibsen, Michael","Plovsing, Ronni R.","Sigurdsson, Sigurdur T.","Iversen, Susanne","Hildebrandt, Thomas","Mohr, Thomas","Espelund, Ulrick Skipper","Jørgensen, Vibeke L.","Haase, Nicolai","Perner, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-429942"],"filters":{"added":"2022-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"thromboembolic and bleeding events in icu patients with covid 000000000019 a nationwide observational study","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/aas.14157","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-429942","identifier":[{"id":"85141525308","type":"scopus"},{"id":"36263897","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC9874434","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-3d18c52a-b741-4e39-983e-7ec7883b3b97"],"lang":"English"