rom MSD Avenir and Alexion and honoraria for lectures from Alexion, Sanofi and Pfizer. . AVDL has received honoraria from Sanofi for participation in an advisory board. PC has received consulting fees from Sanofi, Gilead, Alexion and Janssen and honoraria for lectures from Merck Sharp & Dohme, Gilead, Alexion and Pfizer. PP has received consulting fees from Sanofi and Gilead and honoraria from Merck Sharp & Dohme, Gilead, Mundipharma and Pfizer for academic and educational work. JH has received consulting fees from Paion and honoraria for lectures from the Finnish Medical Association, Laboratory Medicine and Duodecim. EC received fees for lectures and conference talks and had travel and accommodation expenses related to attending scientific meetings covered by Gilead, Shionogi B.V. and Sanofi-Genzyme. ARH has received honoraria from Pfizer for lectures. MHB has received consulting fees from AM-pharma and Inotrem. Full disclosure forms from all authors are available on the publisher’s website."],"id":"S03-091.33-715671","identifier":[{"id":"PMC10622358","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"37812225","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85173919249","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-5a438517-901c-449e-b0ad-fc4335e2f92b","au-eb915366-241a-45e4-a91d-bc808fe7038b","ku-5a3597de-1dfd-490f-a51f-6c6231ea758c"],"keyword":["Bleeding","Critical illness","Intensive care unit","Platelet transfusion","Thrombocytopenia","Thrombosis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-7-9ECC96A66D9A34EA2B4235917CCB7021"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/398566165/s00134-023-07225-2.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/573798190/s00134-023-07225-2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/375195947/s00134_023_07225_2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","