{"abstract":"Udbredelsen og kendskabet til demokratiske virksomheder er begrænset både i det danske samfund, i undervisningssystemet og ikke mindst i rådgivningssystemet. De demokratiske virksomheder kan noget andet end de mere traditionelle virksomheder foruden, at de kan styrke iværksætteri. Det er derfor et problem, at rådgivning og uddannelse i demokratisk iværksætteri er fraværende eller begrænset. Der er således et stort potentiale i at fremme demokratiske virksomhedsformer og demokratisk iværksætteri, men opgaven i at styrke forståelsen og rådgivningen af demokratiske virksomheder er betragtelig. Hvis demokratisk iværksætteri skal tages alvorligt og blive en vigtig spiller samfundsmæssigt, som det er i andre EU-lande, skal det have større politisk bevågenhed og satsning, herunder introduceres i undervisningssystemet.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Nielsen, Lene","Nicolajsen, Hanne Westh","Victor, Fie Foged","Sivertsen, Stine","Baka, Vasiliki","Stana, Raluca Alexandra","Hansen, Anne Vorre","Riisgaard, Lone","Jakobsen, Gurli"],"cuid":["S02-097.13-038418"],"filters":{"added":"2022-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"demokratisk iværksætteri erhvervsfremme og iværksætteri for demokratiske virksomheder i danmark sammenfatning","src":["itu","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/85229673/Demokratisk_Iv_rks_tteri.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-097.13-038418","ids":["itu-fd55a44d-95c3-4819-bf45-fc7d8cafa6ec","ruc-093741bc-4d76-47bd-98be-f01b3b26fea0"],"keyword":["Democratic Entrepreneurship"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-960B38088C4BBC53A863EE905E37F81B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/85229673/Demokratisk_Iv_rks_tteri.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://em.dk/media/14626/analysetema-2-itu.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Communication and Arts"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"1052b289-f510-4c5a-9662-2db48c12ebc2","name":"Nielsen, Lene","orcid":"0000-0003-1768-7147","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne Westh","key":"nicolajsenpau","last":"Nicolajsen","locid":"54728da8-274d-40e6-b119-23318d995721","name":"Nicolajsen, Hanne Westh","orcid":"0000-0002-0158-5034","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vasiliki","key":"bakapau","last":"Baka","locid":"4e33d926-364b-47b8-97d7-409c16b62db9","name":"Baka, Vasiliki","orcid":"0000-0001-7738-7846","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Fie Foged","key":"victorpau","last":"Victor","name":"Victor, Fie Foged","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Stine","key":"sivertsenpau","last":"Sivertsen","name":"Sivertsen, Stine","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Raluca","key":"stanapau","last":"Stana","name":"Stana, Raluca","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Anne Vorre","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"78806e9e-6174-4a3a-a7da-5394113d8366","name":"Hansen, Anne Vorre","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Lone","key":"riisgaardpau","last":"Riisgaard","locid":"7b83c4f1-a827-4f67-8477-54f9b2fa5918","name":"Riisgaard, Lone","orcid":"0000-0002-8827-3227","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Gurli","key":"jakobsenpau","last":"Jakobsen","name":"Jakobsen, Gurli","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"132","place":"København","publisher":"IT-Universitetet i København","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-fd55a44d-95c3-4819-bf45-fc7d8cafa6ec","ruc-093741bc-4d76-47bd-98be-f01b3b26fea0"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Demokratisk Iværksætteri : Erhvervsfremme og iværksætteri for demokratiske virksomheder i Danmark. Sammenfatning","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-097.13-038418","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Background: Pneumococcal prime-boost vaccination is recommended for solid organ transplant recipients and candidates. The long-term durability of the antibody (AB) response is unknown. The same applies to a dose-dependent immune response. Methods: We studied the durability of the vaccine response after 18 months in kidney transplant recipients (KTRs) and patients on the kidney transplant waiting list (WLPs). Both groups received either a normal dose (ND) or a double dose (DD) of the 13-valent pneumococcal conjugate vaccine and the 23-valent pneumococcal polysaccharide vaccine. The average pneumococcal AB geometric mean concentration (GMC) was evaluated. A level ≥ 1 mg/L was considered protective against invasive pneumococcal disease (IPD). Results: Sixty WLPs and 70 KTRs were included. The proportion of participants protected declined from 52% to 33% in WLPs and from 29% to 16% in KTRs, with the previously significant dose-effect in WLPs no longer present (40% DD vs. 27% ND; p = 0.273). Average pneumococcal AB GMCs remained significantly above baseline levels (all groups p ≤ 0.001). Drug-induced immunosuppression diminished the vaccine dose-effect. Conclusions: At follow-up, the pneumococcal prime-boost vaccination still provided significantly elevated average pneumococcal AB GMCs in both populations. Though the proportion of participants protected against IPD in WLP-DD and WLP-ND were statistically comparable, a DD may still be recommended for WLPs (EudraCT: 2016-004123-23).","author_count":8,"contributors":["Larsen, Lykke","Bistrup, Claus","Sørensen, Søren Schwartz","Boesby, Lene","Jørgensen, Charlotte Sværke","Nielsen, Christian","Johansen, Isik Somuncu"],"cuid":["S02-097.86-042639"],"filters":{"added":"2022-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Larsen, Lykke"],"keyword":["Immunogenicity","Kidney transplant recipient"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"durability of antibody response after primary pneumococcal double dose prime boost vaccination in adult kidney transplant recipients and candidates 000000000018 month follow up in a non blinded randomised clinical trial","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/vaccines10071091","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-097.86-042639","identifier":[{"id":"85137279818","type":"scopus"},{"id":"35891255","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC9323946","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-596a1948-8aba-460a-8ff7-cf5c5938828b","sdu-b7da5278-23af-46bb-b019-82b5017cf78c"],"keyword":["13-valent pneumococcal conjugate vaccine","23-valent pneumococcal polysaccharide","immunogenicity","kidney transplant recipient"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-E9120C2991EFAFBAB3C50A7D15D2A3E6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/vaccines10071091","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/321822120/vaccines_10_01091_v2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/205717795/vaccines_10_01091_v2.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Sou