{"abstract":"Flere danske universiteter og virksomheder er gået sammen om at skabe et fælles højteknologisk laboratoriecenter - FOODHAY. Gennem ny forskningsinfrastruktur skal FOODHAY bidrage til at udvikle fremtidens sunde og bæredygtige fødevarer samt mindske madspild gennem avanceret proces- og forskningsudstyr. Foreløbig er samarbejdet etableret med mere end 90 danske og internationale virksomheder","author_count":4,"contributors":["Kornholt, Heidi","Koss, Lene Hundborg","Nielsen, Anne Louise Dannesboe","Bundgaard, Lise"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-314015"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"foodhay samarbejde om fremtidens fødevarer","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-314015","ids":["dtu-1fb10060-5e06-4a24-bbb1-a21ebc91d76d"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-1CDF1785C1894FDF54DD6F799A7DA6AF"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Food Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Technological Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Heidi","key":"kornholtpau","last":"Kornholt","locid":"a86f0b8a-a05f-4def-ad94-d7e1ae726470","name":"Kornholt, Heidi","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene Hundborg","key":"kosspau","last":"Koss","name":"Koss, Lene Hundborg","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne Louise Dannesboe","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Anne Louise Dannesboe","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Lise","key":"bundgaardpau","last":"Bundgaard","name":"Bundgaard, Lise","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["09025057"],"issue":"3","journal":"Plus Proces","pages":"14-16","publisher":"TechMedia AS","publisher_org":"TechMedia A/S","status":"p","title":"Plus Proces","volume":"36"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-1fb10060-5e06-4a24-bbb1-a21ebc91d76d"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"FOODHAY-samarbejde om fremtidens fødevarer","type":"Journal Article","url":"htt