{"abstract":"I samarbejde med forskningsinstitutionerne i FOODHAY kan fødevarevirksomheder bruge biofysikudstyr til at undersøge og måle strukturelle egenskaber i fødevarer og kontaktmaterialer. Det er vigtigt for at kunne udvikle og optimere nye sunde, sikre og bæredygtige fødevarer","author_count":4,"contributors":["Kornholt, Heidi","Koss, Lene Hundborg","Nielsen, Anne Louise Dannesboe","Strandsby, Kristine"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-364689"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"foodhay samarbejde om fødevarebiofysik","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-364689","ids":["dtu-c951e1a4-712a-4724-a063-01cf45a0c1ec"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D4F80387433DCC46F9DB414D7CD4255D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Food Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Technological Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Heidi","key":"kornholtpau","last":"Kornholt","locid":"a86f0b8a-a05f-4def-ad94-d7e1ae726470","name":"Kornholt, Heidi","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene Hundborg","key":"kosspau","last":"Koss","name":"Koss, Lene Hundborg","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne Louise Dannesboe","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Anne Louise Dannesboe","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristine","key":"strandsbypau","last":"Strandsby","name":"Strandsby, Kristine","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["09025057"],"issue":"7","journal":"Plus Proces","publisher":"TechMedia AS","publisher_org":"TechMedia A/S","status":"p","title":"Plus Proces","volume":"36"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-c951e1a4-712a-4724-a063-01cf45a0c1ec"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"FOODHAY-samarbejde om fødevarebiofysik","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-364689","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"User-centric design within organizations is crucial for developing information technology that offers optimal usability and user experience. Personas are a central user-centered design technique that puts people before technology and helps decision makers understand the needs and wants of the end-user segments of their products, systems, and services. However, it is not clear how ready organizations are to adopt persona thinking. To address these concerns, we develop and validate the Persona Readiness Scale (PRS), a survey instrument to measure organizational readiness for personas. After a 12-person qualitative pilot study, the PRS was administered to 372 professionals across different industries to examine its reliability and validity, including 125 for exploratory factor analysis and 247 for confirmatory factor analysis. The confirmatory factor analysis indicated a good fit with five dimensions: Culture readiness, Knowledge readiness, Data and systems readiness, Capability readiness, and Goal readiness. Higher persona readiness is positively associated with the respondents’ evaluations of successful persona projects. Organizations can apply the resulting 18-item scale to identify areas of improvement before initiating costly persona projects towards the overarching goal of user-centric product development. Located at the cross-section of information systems and human–computer interaction, our research provides a valuable instrument for organizations wanting to leverage personas towards more user-centric and empathetic decision making about users.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Salminen, joni","Nielsen, Lene","Bahlouh, Malik","Sørensen, Rasmus Grønlund","Santos, João M.","Jung, Soon-Gyo","Jansen, Bernard J."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384970"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, Middle East","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland","Portugal","Qatar"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Instituto Universitário de Lisboa (ISCTE-IUL)","Qatar Computing Research institute","University of Turku","University of Vaasa"],"keyword":["Human Computer Interaction","Personas","Survey instrument","human centered IT","user empathy"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"persona preparedness a survey instrument for measuring the organizational readiness for deploying personas","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10799-022-00373-9","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384970","identifier":[{"id":"85138123466","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-fb77fcb3-c382-4b7c-affb-c83a61ff93a4"],"keyword":["Human Computer Interaction","human-centered IT","personas","survey instrument","user empathy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5CF540A73E4B395F267036834CF349E4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10799-022-00373-9","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"fi","key":"university of vaasa","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Vaasa","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"qa","key":"qatar computing research institute","loc":["Qatar","Asia, Middle East"],"name":"Qatar Computing Research institute","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"fi","key":"university of turku","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Turku","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"pt","key":"instituto universitário de lisboa","loc":["Portugal","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Instituto Universitário de Lisboa (ISCTE-IUL)","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"joni","key":"salminenpau","last":"Salminen","name":"Salminen, joni","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"1052b289-f510-4c5a-9662-2db48c12ebc2","name":"Nielsen, Lene","orcid":"0000-0003-1768-7147","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Malik","key":"bahlouhpau","last":"Bahlouh","name":"Bahlouh, Malik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Rasmus Grønlund","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Rasmus Grønlund","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"João M.","key":"santospau","last":"Santos","name":"Santos, João M.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Soon-Gyo","key":"jungpau","last":"Jung","name":"Jung, Soon-Gyo","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Bernard J.","key":"jansenpau","last":"Jansen","name":"Jansen, Bernard J.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s10799-022-00373-9","issn":["15737667"],"journal":"Information Technology and Management","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"Information Technology and Management"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85138123466"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-fb77fcb3-c382-4b7c-affb-c83a61ff93a4"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Persona preparedness : a survey instrument for measuring the organizational readiness for deploying personas","type":"Journa