{"abstract":"The report is Denmark’s National Inventory Report 2022, which serves as documentation for the Danish greenhouse gas inventories submitted to the European Union and the United Nations. The report contains information on Denmark’s emission inventories for all years’ from 1990 to 2020 for CO2, CH4, N2O, HFCs, PFCs and SF6.","author_count":21,"contributors":["Nielsen, Ole-Kenneth","Plejdrup, Marlene Schmidt","Winther, Morten","Nielsen, Malene","Gyldenkærne, Steen","Mikkelsen, Mette Hjorth","Albrektsen, Rikke","Thomsen, Marianne","Hjelgaard, Katja Hossy","Fauser, Patrik","Bruun, Henrik Gundorph","Johannsen, Vivian Kvist","Nord-Larsen, Thomas","Vesterdal, Lars","Stupak, Inge","Scott-Bentsen, Niclas","Rasmussen, Erik","Petersen, Susanne Bødtker","Baunbæk, Lene","Hansen, Maria Gunnleivsdóttir"],"cuid":["S02-092.50-024131"],"filters":{"added":"2022-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Nordic"],"country":["Greenland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Statistics Greenland","Umhvørvisstovan (The Environmental Agency. The Faroe Islands)"],"keyword":["CO2","Emission inventory","Greenhouse gases","IPCC","UNFCCC"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Danish Ministry of Climate, Energy and Utilities"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"denmark s national inventory report 000000002022 emission inventories 000000001990 000000002020 submitted under the united nations framework convention on climate change and the kyoto protocol","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/320352894/Denmarks_National_Inventory_Report_2022.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-09