{"author_count":5,"contributors":["Vela, Jonathan","Kristensen, Salome","Dreyer, Lene","Petersen, Kristian Kjær","Arendt-Nielsen, Lars"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-088123"],"event":{"end":"2021-11-09","place":"Virtual conference","start":"2021-11-05","title":"The American College of Rheumatology Convergence 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cannabidiol treatment in hand osteoarthritis and psoriatic arthritis a randomized double blind placebo controlled trial","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-088123","ids":["aau-82d2fd1c-cc22-4523-a831-1d10dcbcef20"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-6A42F9D9FFE9322FE31F251C4FD7907D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Rheumatology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Medicin og Akut"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonathan","key":"velapau","last":"Vela","locid":"d37a71fc-d46e-4ea6-b522-4b4f649c44d7","name":"Vela, Jonathan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Salome","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"9b80939c-06cf-4c5f-8a04-3107ac4426db","name":"Kristensen, Salome","orcid":"0000-0001-5812-5234","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene","key":"dreyerpau","last":"Dreyer","locid":"b12f9d3c-1fa5-4513-8002-c9fd87d60d53","name":"Dreyer, Lene","orcid":"0000-0002-5156-2922","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kristian Kjær","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"03b38a92-c53c-4b31-a786-05e4893a3e14","name":"Petersen, Kristian Kjær","orcid":"0000-0003-4506-000X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars","key":"arendtnielsenpau","last":"Arendt-Nielsen","locid":"1794f9ec-22f1-47af-96c1-88c23c3b06a2","name":"Arendt-Nielsen, Lars","orcid":"0000-0003-0892-1579","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-82d2fd1c-cc22-4523-a831-1d10dcbcef20"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Cannabidiol Treatment in Hand Osteoarthritis and Psoriatic Arthritis – A Randomized, Double-blind Placebo-controlled Trial","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-088123","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Background: Rheumatoid arthritis (RA) is categorized as seropositive or seronegative referring to the presence or absence of IgM rheumatoid factor (IgM-RF) and/ or anti-citrullinated protein antibodies (ACPA).Patients with an autoimmune disease are more likely to develop additional autoimmune conditions than individuals without pre-existing autoimmune disease.Objectives: The aims of this study were to examine patterns of polyautoimmunity in seropositive compared with seronegative patients with recent-onset RA.Methods: The study was register-based and used the nationwide DANBIO register (identification of recent-onset (&lt;1 year) seropositive, ICD-10 M05, and seronegative, M06, RA patients) linked to the Danish National Patient Registry and the Danish National Prescription Registry to obtain information on additional autoimmune diseases (see Table 1 for autoimmune conditions).View this table:Table 1. Characteristics, prevalence, and incidence of polyautoimmunity in incident RA patients.Using age and sex adjusted logistic regression analysis, the odds ratio (OR) of prevalent polyautoimmunity in seropositive compared with seronegative patients at the time of RA diagnosis was calculated.To estimate the hazard ratio (HR) for developing yet another autoimmune disease in the 5 years after RA diagnosis, adjusted cause-specific Cox regression models were performed. Several sensitivity analyses were carried out including alternative exposure and outcome definitions.Results: In total, 12,517 patients with recent-onset RA were included. The groups were similar in terms of disease characteristics and DMARD treatment, but seropositive patients were younger and included more women, see Table 1. Patients with seropositive RA had an OR of 0.79 (95% CI 0.71-0.89) for baseline presence of polyautoimmunity compared with seronegative patients, whereas the 5-year HR was 0.86 (95% CI 0.71-1.05) for incident polyautoimmunity. The results remained similar in all sensitivity analyses.Conclusion: Patients with seropositive RA had a slightly lower prevalence and incidence of polyautoimmunity compared to seropositive patients. The results were somewhat surprising, yet very robust, and thus raises the question if seronegative RA is in fact “more autoimmune” despite the absence of (identified) autoantibodies.Acknowledgements: We acknowledge all patients and all Danish departments of rheumatology contributing to the DANBIO registry.Disclosure of Interests: Amalie Hagelskjær: None declared, René Cordtz: None declared, Sofie Bliddal: None declared, Anders Sandermann Mortensen: None declared, Salome Kristensen: None declared, Claus Henrik Nielsen: None declared, Ulla Feldt-Rasmussen: None declared, Christian Torp-Pedersen: None declared, Lene Dreyer Grant/research support from: Grants from BMS, Galderma, and Eli Lilly","author_count":9,"contributors":["Hagelskjær, Amalie Made","Cordtz, René","Bliddal, S.","Mortensen, A. S.","Kristensen, Salome","Nielsen, C. H.","Feldt-Rasmussen, U.","Torp-Pedersen, C.","Dreyer, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-095247"],"event":{"end":"2021-06-05","place":"Virtuel","start":"2021-06-02","title":"Annual European Congress of Rheumatology, EULAR 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"incidence and prevalence of polyautoimmunity in seropositive compared with seronegative patients with rheumatoid arthritis a nationwide cohort study","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-095247","ids":["aau-9bd30b68-102d-4c51-87df-8257370b54eb"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-246CC00277923C248E4E4C0826752E45"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Rheumatology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Medicin og Akut"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"hagelskjærpau","last":"Hagelskjær","locid":"5d625c1b-27b7-4ddf-b04c-2f820397e210","name":"Hagelskjær, Amalie Made","name_org":"Hagelskjær, A.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"R.","key":"cordtzpau","last":"Cordtz","locid":"49fa43fa-cc2f-4876-bf14-868a1e2288a5","name":"Cordtz, René","name_org":"Cordtz, R.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"S.","key":"bliddalpau","last":"Bliddal","name":"Bliddal, S.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"A. S.","key":"mortensenpau","last":"Mortensen","locid":"9eabc50f-0b4c-47d5-86cd-f94ea14f31f0","name":"Mortensen, A. S.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"S.","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"9b80939c-06cf-4c5f-8a04-3107ac4426db","name":"Kristensen, Salome","name_org":"Kristensen, S.","orcid":"0000-0001-5812-5234","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"C. H.","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, C. H.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"U.","key":"feldtrasmussenpau","last":"Feldt-Rasmussen","name":"Feldt-Rasmussen, U.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"C.","key":"torppedersenpau","last":"Torp-Pedersen","name":"Torp-Pedersen, C.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"L.","key":"dreyerpau","last":"Dreyer","locid":"b12f9d3c-1fa5-4513-8002-c9fd87d60d53","name":"Dreyer, Lene","name_org":"Dreyer, L.","orcid":"0000-0002-5156-2922","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1136/annrheumdis-2021-eular.668","issn":["00034967","14682060"],"issn_org":["00034967"],"issue":"Suppl. 1","journal":"Annals of the Rheumatic Diseases","pages":"382-383","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Annals of the Rheumatic Diseases","volume":"80"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-9bd30b68-102d-4c51-87df-8257370b54eb"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Incidence and prevalence of polyautoimmunity in seropositive compared with seronegative patients with rheumatoid arthritis: a nationwide cohort study","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-095247","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVES: To estimate the incidence of COVID-19 hospitalization in patients with inflammatory rheumatic disease (IRD); in patients with RA treated with specific DMARDs; and the incidence of severe COVID-19 infection among hospitalized patients with RA. METHODS: A nationwide cohort study from Denmark between 1 March and 12 August 2020. The adjusted incidence of COVID-19 hospitalization was estimated for patients with RA; spondyloarthritis including psoriatic arthritis; connective tissue disease; vasculitides; and non-IRD individuals. Further, the incidence of COVID-19 hospitalization was estimated for patients with RA treated and non-treated with TNF-inhibitors, HCQ or glucocorticoids, respectively. Lastly, the incidence of severe COVID-19 infection (intensive care, acute respiratory distress syndrome or death) among hospital-admitted patients was estimated for RA and non-IRD sp - individudals. RESULTS: Patients with IRD (n = 58 052) had an increased partially adjusted incidence of hospitalization with COVID-19 compared with the 4.5 million people in the general population [hazard ratio (HR) 1.46, 95% CI: 1.15, 1.86] with strongest associations for patients with RA (n = 29 440, HR 1.72, 95% CI: 1.29, 2.30) and vasculitides (n = 4072, HR 1.82, 95% CI: 0.91, 3.64). There was no increased incidence of COVID-19 hospitalization associated with TNF-inhibitor, HCQ nor glucocorticoid use. COVID-19 admitted patients with RA had a HR of 1.43 (95% CI: 0.80, 2.53) for a severe outcome. CONCLUSION: Patients with IRD were more likely to be admitted with COVID-19 than the general population, and COVID-19 admitted patients with RA could be at higher risk of a severe outcome. Treatment with specific DMARDs did not affect the risk of hospitalization.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Cordtz, René","Lindhardsen, Jesper","Soussi, B. G.","Vela, Jonathan","Uhrenholt, Line","Westermann, Rasmus","Kristensen, Salome","Nielsen, Henrik","Torp-Pedersen, Christian","Dreyer, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-106631"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Cordtz, René"],"keyword":["DMARDs","Epidemiology","Rheumatoid arthritis","Viruses","biological therapies"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"incidence and severeness of covid 000000000019 hospitalization in patients with inflammatory rheumatic disease a nationwide cohort study from denmark","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7798558/pdf/keaa897.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-106631","identifier":[{"id":"33369663","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85118285908","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-c2fd9541-bb6f-4a88-800b-34643f3b1652"],"keyword":["DMARDs","biological therapies","epidemiology","immunosupressants","rheumatoid arthritis","viruses"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D6DA0FEFB51A990BEA17C5C3F758880B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7798558/pdf/keaa897.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg Unive