timulated conditions","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-513432","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"author_count":7,"contributors":["Nielsen, Silke Griepke Dam","Pereira da Fonseca, Micaella","Grupe, Emilie","Andersen, Lene B.","Lindholt, Jes Sanddal","Stubbe, Jane","Ketelhuth, Daniel F.J."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-636048"],"event":{"end":"2021-10-09","place":"virtual / online","start":"2021-10-08","title":"24th Meeting of the European Council for Cardiovascular Research (ECCR)","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"inhibition of pyruvate dehydrogenase kinase prevents abdominal aortic aneurysm formation in mice","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-636048","ids":["sdu-db6d266a-2c7a-45f7-bd60-f673faf9ec39"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-57BF89173D4E1E8B70200AAAE76713E6"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Molecular Medicine","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Molecular Medicine, Cardiovascular and Renal Research Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Silke Griepke Dam","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"8a4a023d-02bb-4a97-97d6-79b7689732a7","name":"Nielsen, Silke Griepke Dam","orcid":"0000-0002-4256-2541","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Micaella","key":"pereiradafonsecapau","last":"Pereira da Fonseca","locid":"437feee8-67df-45c1-837f-70ad29d9d1f7","name":"Pereira da Fonseca, Micaella","orcid":"0000-0002-0632-0668","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Emilie","key":"grupepau","last":"Grupe","locid":"1f129855-3e16-4d88-9547-a1967fae6fc3","name":"Grupe, Emilie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene B.","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Lene B.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jes Sanddal","key":"lindholtpau","last":"Lindholt","locid":"27d83f24-51cd-4d27-9e32-7501319bdf2b","name":"Lindholt, Jes Sanddal","orcid":"0000-0001-9536-4488","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jane","key":"stubbepau","last":"Stubbe","locid":"f6c78cb4-b790-4690-b62e-fee659666775","name":"Stubbe, Jane","orcid":"0000-0002-2703-453X","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Daniel F. J.","key":"ketelhuthpau","last":"Ketelhuth","locid":"a029aecd-ef34-4940-a9f3-e9df615657d4","name":"Ketelhuth, Daniel F.J.","name_org":"Ketelhuth, Daniel F. J.","orcid":"0000-0002-0087-116X","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-db6d266a-2c7a-45f7-bd60-f673faf9ec39"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Inhibition of pyruvate dehydrogenase kinase prevents abdominal aortic aneurysm formation in mice","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-636048","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Gut-associated lymphoid tissues (GALTs) comprise key intestinal immune inductive sites, including the Peyer’s patches of the small intestine and different types of isolated lymphoid follicle (ILF) found along the length of the gut. Our understanding of human GALT is limited due to a lack of protocols for their isolation. Here we describe a technique that, uniquely among intestinal cell isolation protocols, allows identification and isolation of all human GALT, as well as GALT-free intestinal lamina propria (LP). The technique involves the mechanical separation of intestinal mucosa from the submucosa, allowing the identification and isolation of submucosal ILF (SM-ILF), LP-embedded mucosal ILF (M-ILF) and LP free of contaminating lymphoid tissue. Individual SM-ILF, M-ILF and Peyer’s patch follicles can be subsequently digested for downstream cellular and molecular characterization. The technique, which takes 4–10 h, will be useful for researchers interested in intestinal immune development and function in health and disease.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Peter B.","Fenton, Thomas M.","Mörbe, Urs","Riis, Lene B.","Jakobsen, Henrik L.","Nielsen, Ole H.","Agace, William Winston"],"cuid":["S02-087.50-036949"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Agace, William Winston"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"identification isolation and analysis of human gut associated lymphoid tissues","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/259445178/NP_PI200404B_Agace_Manuscript_Accepted_version_for_Orbit.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["We thank all patients and collaborating staff at Herlev hospital and, in particular, the Gastroenterology Team (Department of Pathology) for help in providing tissue samples. We thank A. Mowat (Glasgow University) for valuable feedback during preparation of the manuscript and J. Vandamme for video editing assistance. This work was supported by grants from the Lundbeck Foundation (R155-2014-4184), Denmark, the Gut Cell Atlas, an initiative funded by the Leona M. and Harry B. Helmsley Charitable Trust, US, the Swedish Research Council (2017-02072) and the Swedish Cancerfonden (18 0598) to W.W.A."],"id":"S02-087.50-036949","identifier":[{"id":"85101262285","type":"scopus"},{"id":"33619391","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-c0301a55-3f30-4456-ae53-e70315bc4ff3","ku-cce69fa8-71c0-4036-9b01-e64f69f6ffee"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-0B483502205E44D94E622933E6EBA7D6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/314957922/NP_PI200404B_Agace_Manuscript_Accepted_version_for_Orbit_2_36.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/259445178/NP_PI200404B_Agace_Manuscript_Accepted_version_for_Orbit.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Experimental & Translational Immunology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Experimental & Translational Immunology, Mucosal Immunology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Pathology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter B.","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"0b540206-3a86-47b0-9154-8d929f8daa13","name":"Jørgensen, Peter B.","orcid":"0000-0001-5262-0074","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas M.","key":"fentonpau","last":"Fenton","locid":"ce3517fb-d4a2-429e-ae4d-a119f3c862cd","name":"Fenton, Thomas M.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Urs M.","key":"mörbepau","last":"Mörbe","locid":"294fc29a-0257-4486-80f9-0fb891d91dc6","name":"Mörbe, Urs","name_org":"Mörbe, Urs M.","orcid":"0000-0001-8747-437X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Lene B","key":"riispau","last":"Riis","locid":"8ec061c0-f464-42fd-ac8d-f972f86292cd","name":"Riis, Lene Buhl","name_org":"Riis, Lene B","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik L","key":"jakobsenpau","last":"Jakobsen","name":"Jakobsen, Henrik L","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Ole H","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"d59658c4-dde8-4749-9b5c-f4ec5910dd02","name":"Nielsen, Ole Haagen","name_org":"Nielsen, Ole H","orcid":"0000-0003-4612-8635","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"William W.","key":"agacepau","last":"Agace","locid":"e34