115113342"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Other Hospitals","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Undetermined","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark","collaboration for research in intensive care"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-cd616cd8-9974-4581-a13f-ee6af03ee1c7","au-d8268126-dc5b-46f9-affe-91abed2274a8","ku-15e1eeec-3995-48c7-854c-4f4e25f30962","sdu-04cd9874-8479-4592-ba28-08e108011723"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Low-dose hydrocortisone in patients with COVID-19 and severe hypoxia : The COVID STEROID randomised, placebo-controlled trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-096.30-009857","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Risk factors for, and long-term outcomes following, detection of varicella zoster virus (VZV) DNA in the cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) are unknown. METHODS: We performed a nationwide population-based cohort study of all Danish residents who had VZV DNA detected in the CSF by polymerase chain reaction (PCR) between 1 January 1997 and 1 March 2016 (VZV cohort; n = 517) and an age- and sex- matched comparison cohort from the general Danish population (n = 9823). We examined potential risk factors and mortality, neurologic morbidity, psychiatric morbidity, redemptiom of prescriptions for nervous system medicine prescribed for the nervous system, and social outcomes. RESULTS: Prior hospital admission, redemption of immunosuppressive medicine, comorbidity, and immunosuppressive conditions were associated with detection of VZV DNA in the CSF. Mortality was increased in the VZV cohort, especially during the first year of observation and among patients with encephalitis. Patients in the VZV cohort had an increased risk of dementia and epilepsy. The redemption of antiepileptics and antidepressants was increased in the VZV cohort. CONCLUSIONS: Immunosuppression and comorbidity are associated with increased risk of detection of VZV DNA in the CSF and the condition is associated with increased mortality and neurological morbidity.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Omland, Lars H","Vestergaard, Hanne T","Dessau, Ram B","Bodilsen, Jacob","Andersen, Nanna S","Christiansen, Claus B","Ellermann-Eriksen, Svend","Nielsen, Lene","Andersen, Christian Ø","Lebech, Anne-Mette","Obel, Niels"],"cuid":["S04-099.97-009551"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Omland, Lars H"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Lund University","Region Skåne"],"keyword":["CNS infection","Meningitis","Varicella zoster virus"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"characteristics and long term prognosis of danish patients with varicella zoster virus detected in cerebrospinal fluid compared with the background population","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/400932793/Omland_et_al._2021_Accepted_Manuscript.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S04-099.97-009551","identifier":[{"id":"33417703","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85116957716","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-c6e279b9-a443-4ea9-81a5-32878f6845c1","au-2c1df405-f925-4b89-8c01-cba0b2b0a5b2","ku-c1e320e5-cf01-44cc-bac9-0944d96fcea6","sdu-60aa6e2e-2150-4406-bf55-5740eb1d6344"],"keyword":["CNS infection","meningitis","varicella zoster virus"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-7-E3C9EE233C1B0118842B83B7B53261DA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/400932793/Omland_et_al._2021_Accepted_Manuscript.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/202224181/Omland_m.fl.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/334006002/Omland_m.fl_2_25.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals",