{"abstract":"The report is Denmark’s National Inventory Report 2020, which serves as documentation for the Danish greenhouse gas inventories submitted to the European Union and the United Nations. The report contains information on Denmark’s emission inventories for all years’ from 1990 to 2018 for CO2, CH4, N2O, HFCs, PFCs and SF6.","author_count":24,"contributors":["Nielsen, Ole-Kenneth","Plejdrup, Marlene Schmidt","Winther, Morten","Nielsen, Malene","Gyldenkærne, Steen","Mikkelsen, Mette Hjorth","Albrektsen, Rikke","Thomsen, Marianne","Hjelgaard, Katja Hossy","Fauser, Patrik","Bruun, Henrik Gundorph","Johannsen, Vivian Kvist","Nord-Larsen, Thomas","Vesterdal, Lars","Callesen, Ingeborg","Caspersen, Ole Hjorth","Bentsen, Niclas Scott","Rasmussen, Erik","Petersen, Susanne Bødtker","Olsen, Tuperna Maliina","Hansen, Maria Gunnleivsdóttir"],"cuid":["S02-095.52-767201"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Nordic"],"corresponding_author":["Nielsen, Ole-Kenneth"],"country":["Greenland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Statistics Greenland","Umhvørvisstovan (The Environmental Agency. The Faroe Islands)"],"keyword":["CO2","Emission inventory","Greenhouse gas emissions","IPCC","UNFCCC"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"denmark s national inventory report 000000002020 emission inventories 000000001990 000000002018 submitted under the united nations framework convention on climate change and the kyoto protocol","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/281664461/SR372.pdf","version":"P