{"abstract":"Chlamydia trachomatis infection is the most common bacterial sexually transmitted infection globally, and nucleic acid amplification tests (NAATs) are recommended for highly sensitive and specific diagnosis. In early 2019, the Finnish new variant of Chlamydia trachomatis (FI-nvCT) was identified. The FI-nvCT has a C1515T mutation in the 23S rRNA gene, making it escaping detection in the Aptima Combo 2 (AC2; Hologic) NAAT, and the FI-nvCT has been subsequently reported in Sweden and Norway. In the present study, we investigated the presence of the FI-nvCT and other AC2 diagnostic-escape CT mutants in July–September 2019 in Denmark. The FI-nvCT was present but rare in Denmark. However, another AC2 diagnostic-escape CT mutant (with a 23S rRNA G1523A mutation) was found to be widespread across Denmark, accounting for 95% (76/80) of AC2 diagnostic-escape nvCT samples from five Danish CT-diagnostic laboratories. This nvCT-G1523A has previously only been detected in one single sample in the United Kingdom and Norway, respectively. It is vital to monitor the continued stability of the NAAT targets in local, national and international settings and monitor as well as appropriately analyse incidence, unexplained shifts in diagnostics rates and/or annual collections of samples diagnosed as negative/equivocal using NAATs with different target(s). Furthermore, diagnostic CT NAATs with dual target sequences are crucial, and fortunately, an updated Hologic AC2 assay including one additional target sequence is in advanced development.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Hadad, Ronza","Jensen, Jørgen Skov","Westh, Henrik","Grønbæk, Ida","Schwartz, Lasse Jessen","Nielsen, Lene","Vang, Tobias Müller","Nielsen, Rikke","Weinreich, Lenette Sandborg","Skov, Marianne Nielsine","Olsen, Marlene","Møller, Jens Kjølseth","Kolmos, Birte","Unemo, Magnus","Hoffmann, Steen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-588519"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Unemo, Magnus"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Örebro University"],"keyword":["23S rRNA","Aptima Combo 2 assay","C1515T","Chlamydia trachomatis","Denmark","FI nvCT","G1523A","new variant"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-NDR","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a chlamydia trachomatis 000000000023s rrna g000000001523a variant escaping detection in the aptima combo 000000000002 assay hologic was widespread across denmark in july september 000000002019","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/170280566/apm.13043.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-588519","identifier":[{"id":"85085151002","type":"scopus"},{"id":"32202687","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-3584d305-e5fb-4a5a-9748-53bdba4c4adb"],"keyword":["23S rRNA","Aptima Combo 2 assay","C1515T","Chlamydia trachomatis","Denmark","FI-nvCT","G1523A","new variant"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-6-166D90BEF8367728B337F578B9415878"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/170280566/apm.13043.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"se","key":"örebro university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Örebro University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ssi statens serum institut","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-SSI","l3nn":"SSI Statens Serum Institut","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SSI Statens Serum Institut","namevar":["Statens Serum Institut"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-SSI","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Hvidovre Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"north denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-NDR","l3nl":"North Denmark Region","l3nn":"North Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"North Denmark Region","namevar":["Aalborg University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-NDR","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Clinical Microbiology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ronza","key":"hadadronzapau","last":"Hadad","name":"Hadad, Ronza","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jørgen Skov","key":"jensenjørgenskovpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Jørgen Skov","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"westhhenrikpau","last":"Westh","name":"Westh, Henrik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Ida","key":"grønbækidapau","last":"Grønbæk","name":"Grønbæk, Ida","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lasse Jessen","key":"schwartzlassejessenpau","last":"Schwartz","name":"Schwartz, Lasse Jessen","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"nielsenlenepau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Lene","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Tobias Müller","key":"vangtobiasmüllerpau","last":"Vang","name":"Vang, Tobias Müller","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Rikke","key":"nielsenrikkepau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Rikke","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Lenette Sandborg","key":"weinreichlenettesandborgpau","last":"Weinreich","name":"Weinreich, Lenette Sandborg","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Marianne N.","key":"skovmariannenielsinepau","last":"Skov","locid":"5b2553ab-dfde-4995-8c58-7840a16be668","name":"Skov, Marianne Nielsine","name_org":"Skov, Marianne N.","orcid":"0000-0002-2619-0864","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Marlene","key":"olsenmarlenepau","last":"Olsen","locid":"3424ab1e-426b-4100-b510-bb8d8471040b","name":"Olsen, Marlene","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Kjølseth","key":"møllerjenskjølsethpau","last":"Møller","locid":"f77ab8d6-2472-488f-8251-27288d59f140","name":"Møller, Jens Kjølseth","orcid":"0000-0002-5547-5498","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Birte","key":"kolmosbirtepau","last":"Kolmos","locid":"9e769468-f88b-464a-878f-772cc4dfd414","name":"Kolmos, Birte","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Magnus","key":"unemomagnuspau","last":"Unemo","name":"Unemo, Magnus","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Steen","key":"hoffmannsteenpau","last":"Hoffmann","name":"Hoffmann, Steen","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["32202687"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/apm.13043","issn":["09034641","0903465X"],"issn_org":["09034641"],"issue":"6","journal":"APMIS","pages":"440-444","publisher":"Wiley","status":"p","title":"APMIS","volume":"128"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85085151002"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-3584d305-e5fb-4a5a-9748-53bdba4c4adb"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"A Chlamydia trachomatis 23S rRNA G1523A variant escaping detection in the Aptima Combo 2 assay (Hologic) was widespread across Denmark in July–September 2019","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-588519","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Cancer-related psychological distress may lead to depression and anxiety among survivors. The vast majority of patients with Hodgkin lymphoma (HL) become long-term survivors, but the risk of mental health problems after HL is not well-characterized. Using national population-based registries, we investigated the cumulative incidence of psychotropic drug (antidepressants, antipsychotics, and anxiolytics) use (proxies for depression and anxiety) in HL patients as well as if an increased risk would normalize over time for patients in remission. The study included 945 HL patients aged 18-92 years and 4725 matched persons. In total, 215 HL patients (22.8%) received a prescription of any psychotropic drug (PD) at some point after date of diagnosis compared to 545 persons (11.5%) in the matched cohort. Cumulative incidences with death/relapse as competing risk confirmed that HL patients were at higher risk of receiving psychotropic drug prescriptions, but the increased risk was transient and normalized to the matched population 5 years into survivorship. Increased age, Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group performance status, and disease stage were associated with higher risk of psychotropic drug prescriptions. Given the increased rate of psychotropic drug prescriptions after HL diagnosis, screening for symptoms of depression and anxiety is warranted after HL diagnosis and first years into survivorship.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Øvlisen, Andreas Kiesbye","Jakobsen, Lasse Hjort","Kragholm, Kristian","Nielsen, René Ernst","Hutchings, Martin","Dahl-Sørensen, Rasmus B","Frederiksen, Henrik","Stoltenberg, Danny","Bøgsted, Martin","Østgård, Lene S G","Severinsen, Marianne Tang","El-Galaly, Tarec Christoffer"],"cuid":["S03-100.00-001512"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["Øvlisen, Andreas K."],"keyword":["Anxiety","Depression","Epidemiology","Hodgkin lymphoma","Psychotropic Drugs"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"depression and anxiety in hodgkin lymphoma patients a danish nationwide cohort study of 000000000945 patients","src":["aau","au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cam4.2981","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S03-100.00-001512","identifier":[{"id":"PMC7300408","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85083509558","type":"scopus"},{"id":"32301251","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-1e19321a-16ab-48e6-815f-306c0faa3080","au-47b19775-0b64-4089-aba1-147543b46293","sdu-c25b805c-11c3-4b27-9c11-46ed8a087087"],"keyword":["Hodgkin lymphoma","anxiety","depression","epidemiology","psychotropic drugs"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-8040BF2876964A6B503B1CC0D1214137"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cam4.2981","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/392037383/_vlisen_et_al._2020_Depression_and_anxiety_in_Hodgkin_lymphoma_patients.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/170051781/cam4.2981.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3