35"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85062595281"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-052610f6-b1aa-4dee-bce9-0fa3049c9389"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"No Difference in Outcome Between Femoral Soft-Tissue and Screw Graft Fixation for Reconstruction of the Medial Patellofemoral Ligament : A Randomized Controlled Trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-132242","year":"2019","yearsub":"2020"}
