{"abstract":"This article presents and discusses the scientific theory and methodological approaches that have been useful in investigating: a) how the formation of professional identity occurs among bachelor students, and b) what characterizes reflexive practice-based learning, when this learning approach is intended to support student formation processes. Our research design has contributed to establish spaces, where researchers and project participants have been able to explore the phenomena together. The research design has also made it possible to obtain a rich empirical material in order to analyze and understand the reflexive processes and the development of a didactic design aimed to support the student's development of professional identity.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nielsen, Lene Stumph","Munch, Per","Nielsen, Annegrethe"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-039634"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Desige Based Research","Læring pædagogik og undervisning","Pragmatisme","Professionel identitet","Professionsuddannelse","Refleksiv praksislæring"],"level":"sci","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"praksisnær forskning dannelse af professionel identitet gennem refleksiv praksislæring","src":["kp","ucn"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://tidsskrift.dk/tipro/article/view/116405/164517","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-039634","ids":["kp-f718b664-7918-4f30-8673-720e44a9ea80","ucn-f718b664-7918-4f30-8673-720e44a9ea80"],"keyword":["Desige-Based Research","Læring, pædagogik og undervisning","Refleksiv praksislæring","pragmatisme","professionel identitet","professionsuddannelse"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-2-3C626324D16C747D0AC14BCA3D46E712"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://tidsskrift.dk/tipro/article/view/116405/164517","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucn university college of northern denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCN","l3nl":"University College of Northern Denmark","l3nn":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen UCN, UCN Direktion, UCN Velfærd, Jordemoderuddannelsen"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCN","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Rektors område, Fakultet for sundhedsuddannelser - Dekan, Sygeplejerskeuddannelsen 1"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene Stumph","key":"nielsenlenestumphpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"1c5a9b0e-c3dc-455f-b54c-954d70b8a04c","name":"Nielsen, Lene Stumph","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Per","key":"munchperpau","last":"Munch","locid":"dc1e2ae1-ce84-47c1-ba10-acd9a20b58af","name":"Munch, Per","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Annegrethe","key":"nielsenannegrethepau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"bcda89b7-0b30-4c86-a0c1-ea96eb26a849","name":"Nielsen, Annegrethe","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["19041918","24460273"],"issn_org":["24460273"],"issue":"29","journal":"Tidsskrift for professionsstudier","pages":"62-66","publisher":"VIA University College","status":"p","title":"Tidsskrift for professionsstudier","volume":"15"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","KP","University College of Northern Denmark","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kp-f718b664-7918-4f30-8673-720e44a9ea80","ucn-f718b664-7918-4f30-8673-720e44a9ea80"],"src":["KP University College Copenhagen","UCN University College of Northern Denmark"],"title":"Praksisnær forskning : dannelse af professionel identitet gennem refleksiv praksislæring","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-039634","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVES: The Danish Myeloma Study Group initiated a randomized, placebo-controlled, double-blinded phase II study to investigate the efficacy of adding clarithromycin to cyclophosphamide-bortezomib-dexamethasone (VCD) induction therapy in transplant eligible, newly diagnosed multiple myeloma patients. The study was prematurely terminated due to severe complications, and no effect of adding clarithromycin was found. The aim of this study was to compare health-related quality of life (HRQoL) between the two groups and to explore the coherence hereof with adverse event (AE) registration by clinicians. METHODS: Patients completed three validated HRQoL questionnaires at inclusion, before cyclophosphamide priming, and two months after high-dose therapy (HDT). The mean score difference was interpreted by clinically relevant differences between groups. Spearman correlation analysis was used to compare patient-reported toxicities with AEs. RESULTS: Of 58 included patients, 55 participated in the HRQoL reporting. Before cyclophosphamide priming, patients in the clarithromycin group reported clinically relevant reduced HRQoL for eleven domains with persistent reduction in four domains two months after HDT. Poor correlation between patient-reported toxicities and clinician-reported AEs was observed. CONCLUSIONS: Despite the premature study termination, our data demonstrate impaired HRQoL when clarithromycin was added to the VCD regimen. We found clear underreporting of toxicities by clinicians. ClinicalTrials. gov number NCT02573935. This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Nielsen, Lene Kongsgaard","Klausen, Tobias Wirenfeldt","Jarden, Mary","Frederiksen, Henrik","Vangsted, Annette Juul","Do, Trung","Kristensen, Ida Bruun","Frølund, Ulf Christian","Andersen, Christen Lykkegaard","Abildgaard, Niels","Gregersen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S03-099.52-009373"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"auth