{"abstract":"With a critical assessment of morphomic morphology (Aronoff 1994, Maiden 2008) as point of departure, this paper presents an analysis of the structure of the Danish verb forstå ‘understand’ and its development from Early Middle Danish to Modern Danish. Based on a semiotic-functional framework (Andersen 1980, 2010; Harder 1996), the analysis examines the strong past tense form forstod ‘understood’ and its relation to the inflection of the simplex verb stå ‘stand’. The original isomorphism between expression plane and content plane has been lost, but indexical relations on the two planes ensure that structural meaningfulness is maintained. The structure and development of forstå is compared to that of the verb overvære ‘attend, witness’, and the paper offers an alternative strategy to Aronoff’s (1976, 1994) morphome analysis of English understand.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Nielsen, Peter Juul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-596823"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Nielsen, Peter Juul"],"keyword":["Compositionality","Danish","Indexicality","Isomorphism","Metaphor","Paradigms"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"diachronic morphology indexical function and a critique of the morphome analysis the content and expression of danish i forstå i","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-596823","ids":["sdu-5251ee88-223e-44e5-9c12-268f083def66"],"keyword":["Danish","compositionality","diachronic morphology","indexicality","isomorphism","metaphor","morphomes","paradigms","verbal inflection"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-4010EB412D7EF8DA026A7868111E8795"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Language and Communication"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter Juul","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"45b7d6e7-2b01-4016-8e7a-d62b194bfca5","name":"Nielsen, Peter Juul","orcid":"0000-0002-5202-304X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lars","key":"heltoftpedh","last":"Heltoft","name":"Heltoft, Lars","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Iván","key":"igartuapedh","last":"Igartua","name":"Igartua, Iván","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Brian D.","key":"josephpedh","last":"Joseph","name":"Joseph, Brian D.","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Kirsten Jeppesen","key":"kraghpedh","last":"Kragh","name":"Kragh, Kirsten Jeppesen","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Lene","key":"schøslerpedh","last":"Schøsler","name":"Schøsler, Lene","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1075/cilt.345.05nie","eisbn":["9789027262639"],"isbn":["9789027203090"],"issn":["03040763"],"pages":"125-150","publisher":"John Benjamins Publishing Company","series":"Current Issues in Linguistic Theory","status":"p","subtitle":"Studies in honor of Henning Andersen","title":"Perspectives on Language Structure and Language Change"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-5251ee88-223e-44e5-9c12-268f083def66"],"src":["SDU Univers