{"abstract":"An upper extremity vascular access (VA) is preferred for haemodialysis, but when the central veins are occluded or all opportunities are exhausted, a lower extremity VA is necessary. Transposition of the superficial femoral vein is a durable arteriovenous fistula and should be the first choice in patients with long expected remaining lifetime. Peripheral arterial disease and heart failure are contraindications, and careful selection of the patients is mandatory. There is a risk of ischaemic steal and an even higher risk of wound complications. It is recommended, that the procedure is centralised.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Langhoff Clausen, Lene","Nielsen, Judith"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-605771"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"arteriovenøs fistel med transponeret vena femoralis er en hæmodialyseadgangsvej med potentiale","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85127895355","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-605771","identifier":[{"id":"85127895355","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-71de4498-c6d3-4962-a57b-95767e3b50fb"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-26484213DCE1F8D957B9EB2F8EFCD374"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Cardiac, thoracic, and Vascular surgery (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"langhoffclausenpau","last":"Langhoff Clausen","locid":"ec242cf0-e0df-46ed-bc66-84f913ad8269","name":"Langhoff Clausen, Lene","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Judith","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"71553f44-421c-4950-9af3-237487003696","name":"Nielsen, Judith","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["00415782","13994174"],"issn_org":["00415782"],"issue":"2","journal":"Ugeskrift for Læger","paperid":"V12170940","publisher":"Lægeforeningen","status":"p","title":"Ugeskrift for Læger","volume":"180"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85127895355"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-71de4498-c6d3-4962-a57b-95767e3b50fb"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Arteriovenøs fistel med transponeret vena femoralis er en hæmodialyseadgangsvej med potentiale","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-605771","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
