{"abstract":"Dette essay udspringer af vores erfaringer med at blive forvekslet med hinanden i konteksten af dansk akademia. At blive forvekslet er selvfølgelig ikke en erfaring, der er forbeholdt østasiatiske kroppe som vores. Vores afsæt er den racialiserende forveksling, som produceres gennem et hvidt akademisk blik, der både udvisker forskellighed og bestemmer hvilke former for forskellighed, der skal tillægges vægt og betydning. Vi anvender dermed forvekslingerne som en indgang til at reflektere over, hvordan race og hvidhed fungerer som organiserende principper i akademia, og på hvilke måder forskellige former for racialiseringsprocesser gør sig gældende i vores arbejdsliv.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Li, Jin Hui","Nielsen, Louise Yung","Spanger, Marlene","Myong, Lene"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-005090"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Stavanger"],"keyword":["Academia","Gender","Racialisation","Racism"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"de andre tegn på kroppen","src":["aau","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.7146/kkf.v28i1-2.116120","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-005090","identifier":[{"id":"85149341054","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-69200628-6006-478d-8510-328781ad16f2","ruc-5403c6c2-b7f2-41cf-95b0-704578d93437"],"keyword":["Academia","Gender","Racialisation","Racism"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-022C76F7A6BBB8575EC682F0FFCF5038"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.7146/kkf.v28i1-2.116120","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities, Department of Learning and Philosophy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities, Department of Learning and Philosophy, Centre for Education Policy Research (Learning)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities, Department of Learning and Philosophy, Forskningsgruppen i Sundhed, Organisation, Uddannelse og Læring (SOUL)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Communication and Arts"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"no","key":"university of stavanger","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Stavanger","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jin Hui","key":"lipau","last":"Li","locid":"75e04521-95b0-4dcd-9f5e-445b73be1d78","name":"Li, Jin Hui","orcid":"0000-0003-3546-7324","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Louise Yung","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"aa67470a-84d1-421c-91e3-2bd6e0ce1604","name":"Nielsen, Louise Yung","orcid":"0000-0001-8829-6085","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Marlene","key":"spangerpau","last":"Spanger","locid":"98fcf0be-b8a2-4109-8c3c-efb4b466b293","name":"Spanger, Marlene","orcid":"0000-0001-7220-1758","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3",