{"abstract":"Psykofysiologiske metoder handler om psykologiske processer der kan måles via fysiologiske reaktioner. Målingerne bruger teknologi til at forstå og analysere menneskers emotioner og deres opmærksomhed på forskellige former for stimuli (fx tv-sening). Psykofysiologi bruger ofte en model (Rusell, 1980), som placerer emotionelle oplevelser i forhold til to dimensioner: valens (i hvilket omfang den emotionelle oplevelse er positiv eller negativ) og arousal (niveauet af kropslig respons).","author_count":6,"contributors":["Bjørner, Thomas","Heiselberg, Lene","Due, Brian Lystgaard"],"cuid":["S02-086.67-006921"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Danmarks Radio"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"psykofysiologiske metoder","src":["aau","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk:8443/ws/portalfiles/portal/155354242/Metodekogebogen_Psykofysiologiske_m_linger_Thomas_Bj_rner_05.02.2018.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-086.67-006921","ids":["aau-8ed543ec-7876-424f-8b1a-98c8c800a6c6","ku-12e63dad-4864-4374-a0c4-ee222e470b46"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-C77485A6D49EE2C0987B7896FD90B467"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk:8443/ws/portalfiles/portal/155354242/Metodekogebogen_Psykofysiologiske_m_linger_Thomas_Bj_rner_05.02.2018.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, MeCIS - Media Cognition and Interactive Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Media Innovation & Game Research (Me-Ga)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Mobility and Tracking Technologies","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Copenhagen","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, The Center for Applied Game Research"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Nordic Studies and Linguistics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Danmarks Radio"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"bjørnerpau","last":"Bjørner","locid":"65c6cc27-0e30-49d1-aa84-7cbc986fa9e1","name":"Bjørner, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0001-9071-7168","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"aff