frederiksenhenrikpau","last":"Frederiksen","locid":"6e4bf33a-3b75-42c4-b830-43e26dcea675","name":"Frederiksen, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-8905-0220","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels","key":"abildgaardnielspau","last":"Abildgaard","locid":"595418b9-29f8-4fd3-8663-1b32eab3451a","name":"Abildgaard, Niels","orcid":"0000-0001-6852-2014","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1182/blood-2019-128074","issn":["00064971","15280020"],"issn_org":["00064971"],"issue":"Supplement 1","journal":"Blood","paperid":"1849","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Blood","volume":"134"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Region Zealand","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-13a161c3-1f83-49b9-aec1-7f0d62aef9a9"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Validation of a New Clinical Prediction Model for Outcome in Newly Diagnosed Multiple Myeloma Patients Not Eligible for Autologous Stem-Cell Transplantation; A Population-Based Study from the Danish National Multiple Myeloma Registry","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-578795","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Multiple myeloma (MM) is a malignancy of the plasma cells in the bone marrow. MM primarily affects the elderly with a median age at diagnosis of about 70 years. Worldwide, it is estimated that 86,000 patients are diagnosed with MM yearly. MM is incurable, but treatment-sensitive, and the typical course of the disease is periods with symptomatic, treatment-demanding disease alternating with periods of remission without need of treatment. Due to novel treatments, the prognosis has improved over the last two decades, and overall survival for patients below 70 years now exceeds 6-7 years. As a result, myeloma patients might experience severe morbidity caused by bone destruction/fractures, renal dysfunction, bone marrow failure and high infection rates. In addition, they might be subject to adverse events and/or late sequelae to repeated lines of treatment. The impact of the disease and treatment on patients defines the health-related quality of life (HRQoL) and can be assessed by patientreported outcome (PRO) questionnaires. Methodological challenges in interpretation of longitudinal HRQoL results have been identified and we here present the three challenges relevant for this thesis. One of the challenges is to determine a correct threshold for clinical meaningful treatment effect on HRQoL from the patients´ perspective. Another challenge is that patients might adapt to changes in HRQoL, which could affect the patients´ answers to the questions in the questionnaires and complicate interpretation of results. A third challenge is, if the patients do not complete the questionnaires, since there is a risk of biased results, if the non-responses are related to the patients´ poor health. The overall aim of the thesis is to determine if PRO data are valuable tools for assessing clinically meaningful effect on HRQoL from the MM patients´ perspective in spite of methodological challenges. The first aim was to interpret published longitudinal studies using the EORTC QLQ-C30 questionnaires for HRQoL measurement according to thresholds for clinically meaningful treatment effects on HRQoL. The second aim was to determine the clinically meaningful treatment effect on HRQoL of four first line treatment regimens using the EORTC QLQ-C30 questionnaires with the addition of EORTC QLQ-MY20 and relate the results to previous findings. The third aim was to analyse the magnitude of non-responses in longitudinal studies with MM and determine the effect of implemented strategies to reduce non-responses during follow-up in an ongoing longitudinal HRQoL study of patients with MM. To elucidate the first aim, a systematic literature search was performed with identification of 18 longitudinal HRQoL studies of patients with newly diagnosed or relapsed MM, where the EORTC QLQ-C30 questionnaire was used. Clinically meaningful improvements in global QoL, physical functioning and reduction of pain and fatigue were found far more likely during primary treatment regimens, whereas relapsed patients reported no change or even deterioration in HRQoL. To answer the second aim, HRQoL data from two clinical trials in newly diagnosed MM patients, where the EORTC QLQ-C30 and EORTC QLQ-MY20 instruments were used for HRQoL measurement were analysed. The general findings were confirmed, since the newly diagnosed patients with MM reported clinical meaningful improvement in HRQoL during treatment. However, a noteworthy exception was patients treated with clarithromycin added to the bortezomib-cyclophosphamide-dexamethasone induction before high dose therapy with stem cell support. These patients reported increased fatigue, insomnia and appetite loss and increasing score for side effects of treatment during treatment. This resulted in lack of clinically meaningful improvement in global quality of life and physical functioning as well as decreased social functioning and body image during treatment. In spite of that, the patients reported increased emotional functioning after treatment, which differ from the patients in the placebo group, who reported unchanged emotional functioning. To illuminate the third aim, information of the magnitude of non-responses from the 18 studies identified to elucidate the first aim, and the two studies analysed as part of answering the second aim were extracted. The non-responses rate during follow-up was between 2 and 22%. Compared to number of patients at baseline, the proportion of non-responses due to study discontinuation was between 27 and 99%. In the ongoing longitudinal HRQoL study, study nurses are being educated in prevention of nonresponses. Patients, who have not completed the questionnaires receive reminders, and later, if the patients still have not completed the questionnaire, the study nurses contact the patients. The applied strategies resulted in a rate of non-responses in follow-up of 5%. We concluded that PRO tools can assess clinically meaningful treatment effects on HRQoL from the MM patients´ perspective, if the study is well-designed and methodological challenges are addressed. The EORTC QLQ-C30 and EORTC QLQ-MY20 questionnaires are only validated in newly diagnosed MM patients, and the side effect of treatment domain of EORTC QLQ-MY20 is not developed to capture symptomatic toxicities of novel anti-myeloma drugs or drug combinations. The three methodological challenges in longitudinal HRQoL measurement need further investigation in MM. Firstly, valid thresholds to assess clinically meaningful treatment effects from the MM patients´ perspective are needed. Secondly, possible adaption to change in HRQoL needs further investigation and should be integrated into thresholds for clinically meaningful change. Lastly, the high magnitude of nonresponses to questionnaires found in HRQoL studies of patients with MM might have biased the existing HRQoL results. Now, we have practical tools to reduce NRs during follow-up, but statistical methods for handling of unavoidable NR in order to reduce selection bias need further development. ","author_count":1,"contributors":["Kongsgaard Nielsen, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-627492"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"longitudinal patient reported outcomes in patients with multiple myeloma","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/173376438/PhD_thesis_and_Appendix_I_V_20DEC2018_Lene_Kongsgaard_Nielsen.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-627492","ids":["sdu-bd478938-4411-44ec-8fd3-113222b89be2"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2E2DB397CDB68FC634BB365FCE1721BD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/173376438/PhD_thesis_and_Appendix_I_V_20DEC2018_Lene_Kongsgaard_Nielsen.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Haematology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"kongsgaardnielsenpau","last":"Kongsgaard Nielsen","locid":"621d166f-6298-48ed-9f2d-d8d52bb40446","name":"Kongsgaard Nielsen, Lene","orcid":"0000-0003-2083-3870","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"210","place":"Odense","publisher":"Syddansk Universitet. Det Sundhedsvidenskabelige Fakultet","status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-bd478938-4411-44ec-8fd3-113222b89be2"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Longitudinal patient-reported outcomes in patients with multiple myeloma","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-627492","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"I denne podcast har vi fokus på et didaktisk design med titlen Virtuel Kommune. Underviserne Lene Faurholt Gravgaard og Line Ehrenreich (begge fra uddannelsen Offentlig Administration) fortæller om deres pædagogiske overvejelser ved at simulere en kommune ved hjælp af en Klassenotesbog i et et-uges forløb. De studerende Louise Sofie Bøgsted Tønnesen og Mette Koldbro Hermansen giver også deres besyv med og der er gode overvejelser omkring motivation, engagement, forstyrrelser og Refleksiv praksislæring. I serien: UCN Pædagogisk it Podcast (PIP) PIP er en podcast-serie udviklet af Pædagogisk IT på Professionshøjskolen UCN","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nielsen, Steen","Kristensen, Søren Mikael","Gravgaard, Lene Faurholt","Ehrenreich, Line"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-651280"],"filters":{"added":"2023-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"virtuel kommune pip episode 000000000003","src":["ucn"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.spreaker.com/user/ucnpodcast/episode-3-virtuel-kommune","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-651280","ids":["ucn-73d8f0a7-e30e-4d54-bd87-4d6aacaf6cdf"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3389230839F453E8535EA76E2020233F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.spreaker.com/user/ucnpodcast/episode-3-virtuel-kommune","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucn university college of northern denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCN","l3nl":"University College of Northern Denmark","l3nn":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen UCN, UCN Direktion, UCN IT og Digitalisering"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCN","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Steen","key":"nielsenoth","last":"Nielsen","locid":"0aad4ec4-c6c4-4c11-9958-428ec29c58bf","name":"Nielsen, Steen","rank":1,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Mikael","key":"kristensenoth","last":"Kristensen","locid":"6e8f0804-825f-406d-82cc-e40a3dcce349","name":"Kristensen, Søren Mikael","rank":2,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene Faurholt","key":"gravgaardoth","last":"Gravgaard","locid":"2a19c92d-b62c-4cdb-bf37-dd231f623ba0","name":"Gravgaard, Lene Faurholt","rank":3,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Line","key":"ehrenreichoth","last":"Ehrenreich","locid":"11f5776b-7457-4287-9ae0-b75daae85a3b","name":"Ehrenreich, Line","rank":4,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"}],"pub":{"publisher":"UCN","status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University College of Northern Denmark","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucn-73d8f0a7-e30e-4d54-bd87-4d6aacaf6cdf"],"src":["UCN University College of Northern Denmark"],"title":"Virtuel kommune : PIP Episode 3","type":"Non-Textual Item","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-651280","year":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Vandrammedirektivet foreskriver, at medlemsstaterne skal indsamle oplysninger om type og omfang af de signifikante menneskeskabte belastninger og deres virkninger på kystvandenes tilstand. Forskning har tidligere vurderet, at den mest betydende presfaktor er belastningen med N og P. En række andre presfaktorer kan imidlertid belaste det marine miljø, men der findes ikke en samlet vurdering af betydningen af disse presfaktorer for miljøtilstanden i kystvandene, som den defineres i VRD. For at forbedre plangrundlaget i 3. generations vandplaner har Miljøstyrelsen derfor iværksat indsatser til belysning af andre presfaktorer. I denne analyse har vi på baggrund af strukturerede reviews analyseret presfaktorerne: Råstofindvinding, klapning og graveaktiviter, fysiske konstruktioner, fiskeri, skibstrafik, plastik, miljøfarlige stoffer og invasive arter. De invasive arter er repræsenteret ved 4 karakteristiske arter. Analysen har taget udgangspunkt i, at tilstedeværelse alene ikke er tilstrækkelig, der skal være en påvirkningsmekanisme på et eller flere af kvalitetselementerne (fytoplankton, makroalger, angiospermer og bundfauna) og/eller støtteparametrene (iltforhold og sigtdybde), for at det kan siges, at presfaktorerne har en virkning jf. VRD. Da indsatser for at forbedre vandmiljøet bliver planlagt på niveau af vandområder, skal effekten af presfaktoren endvidere kunne detekteres på dette niveau. For at kunne beskrive og dokumentere en evt. betydende påvirkning af en given presfaktor på kvalitetselementerne i et vandområde er det endvidere nødvendigt, at der er et tilstrækkeligt datagrundlag til at analysere den konkrete sammenhæng mellem presfaktoren og kvalitetselementerne/støtteparametrene. På baggrund af kriterier om dokumenteret påvirkningsmekanisme, potentiel væsentlighed og datagrundlag er de nævnte presfaktorer blevet gennemgået og vi præsenterer her resultater og anbefalinger vedrørende inkludering af presfaktorerne i analyserne i 3. generations vandplaner.","author_count":31,"contributors":["Petersen, Jens Kjerulf","Holm, A.-P. S.","Christensen, A.","Krekoutiotis, D.","Jakobsen, Hans","Sanderson, Hans","Andreasen, H.","Gislason, H.","Strand, Jakob","Behrens, J.","Hansen, Jens Würgler","Svendsen, C.","Timmermann, Karen","Møller, L. Friis","Bach, Lis","Larsen, Martin Mørk","Zrust, Martina Olga","Møller Nielsen, M.","Eigaard, Ole Ritzau","Nielsen, P.","Stæhr, Peter A.","Høgslund, Signe","Nielsen, Torkel Gissel"],"cuid":["S02-082.19-021026"],"event":{"end":"2019-01-25","place":"Odense, dk","start":"2019-01-23","title":"Dansk Havforskermøde 2019","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"andre presfaktorer end næringsstoffer og klimaforandringer","src":["au","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/180022035/Dok2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-082.19-021026","ids":["au-72485b80-42e8-421b-a735-4431bb0d0208","dtu-ce9c0bab-aaff-4bee-8781-ab06b6d7daec"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-68834B1681CC75E5057A99FB13FA2B36"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/180022035/Dok2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.dhm2019.dk/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Institute of Aquatic Resources","Technical University of Denmark, National Institute of Aquatic Resources, Danish Shellfish Centre"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Marine Diversity and Experimental Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Kjerulf","key":"petersenjenskjerulfpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"bb405fca-78e7-4f2c-b4ad-30806ef2fad7","name":"Petersen, Jens Kjerulf","orcid":"0000-0002-6412-7022","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Andrea-Pil Sussie","key":"holmandreapilsussiepau","last":"Holm","locid":"35b80342-1f28-4476-a021-32920dffb43d","name":"Holm, Andrea-Pil Sussie","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Asbjørn","key":"christensenasbjørnpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"7f289a6a-4b39-4ff8-8759-b22fa803681e","name":"Christensen, Asbjørn","orcid":"0000-0002-4286-7409","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Dionysios","key":"krekoukiotisdionysiospau","last":"Krekoukiotis","locid":"f5d4657d-2817-4be0-ad51-c791ddf60412","name":"Krekoukiotis, Dionysios","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans","key":"jakobsenhanspau","last":"Jakobsen","locid":"115e2890-be07-49a8-a340-d271dd22ac2b","name":"Jakobsen, Hans","orcid":"0000-0001-9590-2362","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"H.","key":"jakobsenhpau","last":"Jakobsen","name":"Jakobsen, H.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans","key":"sandersonhanspau","last":"Sanderson","locid":"b9dc5d4d-6455-44cc-a26b-9ebe17989c53","name":"Sanderson, Hans","orcid":"0000-0002-3765-4310","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"H.","key":"sandersonhpau","last":"Sanderson","name":"Sanderson, H.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Heidi","key":"andreasenheidipau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"88f2bb4e-b73e-4900-ae06-50882367fcc7","name":"Andreasen, Heidi","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"gislasonhenrikpau","last":"Gislason","locid":"be3baedb-057e-42c9-b848-6387b47f46c7","name":"Gislason, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0003-0242-3333","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jakob","key":"strandjakobpau","last":"Strand","locid":"1732956e-329d-417f-807a-bb90099be1d0","name":"Strand, Jakob","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"J.","key":"strandjpau","last":"Strand","name":"Strand, J.","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jane","key":"behrensjanepau","last":"Behrens","locid":"643c66d3-1142-4bf6-89ac-05006210012c","name":"Behrens, Jane","orcid":"0000-0002-0136-9681","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Würgler","key":"hansenjenswürglerpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"2c80f917-d59f-4eca-9101-524a9380b689","name":"Hansen, Jens Würgler","orcid":"0000-0002-6829-7248","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"J. Würgler","key":"hansenjwürglerpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, J. Würgler","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jon Christian","key":"svendsenjonchristianpau","last":"Svendsen","locid":"2208c455-c4d1-4ba7-a638-9062097f640b","name":"Svendsen, Jon Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-0273-0985","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}