itle":"The effect of botulinum neurotoxin A in patients with plaque psoriasis - an exploratory trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-080.71-672150","year":"2018","yearsub":2018}
{"abstract":"Agile project management processes (Agile) such as Scrum, DSDM, XP and Kanban, have become a de facto standard for software development practice. The context of Agile strongly affects the possibilities of IT professionals to conduct UX activities in their software development. In this workshop we aim to address successes, challenges and best practices from integrating UX activities in Agile. Particularly, we want to focus on two periods for the integration: Before the actual agile project management starts and during the agile projects. The overall objective of this workshop is to provide a venue for researchers and practitioners, from within and outside of HCI, to discuss and suggest good ways of integrating UX in Agile. The workshop has two goals: (1) Identifying best practices, case studies and work-in-progress relevant to successes and challenges of integrating UX activities in Agile. (2) Identify and discuss suggestions for good ways of integrating UX activities in Agile.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Larusdottir, Marta","Nielsen, Lene","Bruun, Anders","Larsen, Lars Bo","Nielsen, Peter Axel","Persson, John Stouby"],"cuid":["S02-081.03-000585"],"event":{"acronym":"NordiCHI","end":"2018-10-03","place":"Oslo, no","start":"2018-10-01","title":"Nordic Conference on Human-Computer Interaction","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Iceland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Reykjavík University"],"keyword":["Agile processes","Agile project management","Best practices","Case studies","Challenges","HCI","Kanban","Scrum","Software development","UX integration","User centred design","User experience","User perspectives"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ux in agile before and during development nordichi 000000000018","src":["aau","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/83578993/UX_in_Agile_before_and_during_development.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-081.03-000585","identifier":[{"id":"85056611705","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-0b199890-3455-401d-a80a-6682ad380c70","itu-4d744ebb-8bb5-431c-a642-ae3f608e34e7"],"keyword":["Agile processes","Agile project management","Best practices","Case studies","Challenges","HCI","Kanban","Scrum","Software development","UX integration","User Centred Design","User Experience","User perspectives"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-9A9478229A3DA6204C33DBEBD8228EC9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/83578993/UX_in_Agile_before_and_during_development.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"is","key":"reykjavík university","loc":["Iceland","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Reykjavík University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, 