{"abstract":"Ammonia can be recovered from liquid biogas digestate as ammonium sulfate by air stripping. A full-scale plant treating 30,000 kg h−1 of digestate was simulated in Aspen Plus.The classical sequence stripper–absorber was modified by introducing a flash drum to reduce the buffer capacity. The stripped digestate was mixed with NaOH up to a pH value of 9 and fed to the stripping column using air at 90 °C. The air flow rate was optimized considering the possible recycle from the absorption column. The complete process was modeled using the process simulator Aspen Plus considering a recovery of ammonia equal to 95%. The total capital investment was evaluated by means of Aspen Plus Process Economic Analyzer in about 5.5 million US$, and the costs of energy and chemicals were quantified in less than 1 million US$ year−1. A benefit of 1.6 US$ for m3 of digestate was obtained considering an ammonium sulfate price of 522 US$ ton−1.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Errico, Massimiliano","Fjerbæk Søtoft, Lene","Kjærhuus Nielsen, Anne","Norddahl, Birgir"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-583800"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Errico, Massimiliano"],"keyword":["Air stripping","Ammonia recovery","Biogas digestate","Process simulation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Renew Energy"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"treatment costs of ammonia recovery from biogas digestate by air stripping analyzed by process simulation","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/145052986/Rev2_Treat_costs_of_ammonia_recovery_from_biogas_dig.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-583800","identifier":[{"id":"85034824638","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-24e39fc1-f5fc-48fa-b40d-0b1962f6a531"],"keyword":["Air stripping","Ammonia recovery","Biogas digestate","Process simulation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DC9D7D04A9F8598B110C5EDA4AD01AEF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/145052986/Rev2_Treat_costs_of_ammonia_recovery_from_biogas_dig.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Green Technology (IGT)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Renew Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Massimiliano","key":"erricopau","last":"Errico","locid":"f5229d3d-ef04-4739-bcda-be5ead45dcbe","name":"Errico, Massimiliano","orcid":"0000-0002-2172-2921","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"fjerbaeksotoftpau","last":"Fjerbaek Sotoft","locid":"00447b51-640b-4b39-a5d3-baca314204fd","name":"Fjerbæk Søtoft, Lene","name_org":"Fjerbaek Sotoft, Lene","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne","key":"kjærhuusnielsenpau","last":"Kjærhuus Nielsen","name":"Kjærhuus Nielsen, Anne","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Birgir","key":"norddahlpau","last":"Norddahl","locid":"536a0b41-cddd-414d-950d-c064201806a0","name":"Norddahl, Birgir","orcid":"0000-0002-9423-5411","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s10098-017-1468-0","issn":["1618954X","16189558"],"issn_org":["1618954X"],"issue":"7","journal":"Clean Technologies and Environmental Policy","pages":"1479-1489","publisher":"Springer Science+Business Media","status":"p","title":"Clean Technologies and Environmental Policy","volume":"20"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85034824638"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-24e39fc1-f5fc-48fa-b40d-0b1962f6a531"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Treatment costs of ammonia recovery from biogas digestate by air stripping analyzed by process simulation","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-583800","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
