{"abstract":"Med udgangspunkt i en kasuistik beskrives udredning og behandling af hunde med migrerende fremmedlegemer – i dette tilfælde engræsavne. På grund af græsavnens størrelse og store evne til migrationer symptombilledet varierende, diagnostikken udfordrende og kirurgisk eksstirpation ofte vanskelig. Ultralydsskanning er en brugbar metode til påvisning og lokalisering af en migrerende græsavne, og en ultralydsguidet kirurgisk eksstirpation kan anbefales.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Nielsen, Michelle Brønniche Møller","Sahl, Pia","Westrup, Ulrik","Buelund, Lene Elisabeth","Eriksen, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-477650"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"migrerende fremmedlegeme i psoas muskulaturen hos en korthåret hønsehund","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/256982012/16922.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-477650","ids":["ku-8cd31241-2e05-41d4-a1b1-988a93f3b6b1"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C677514004FB5AD2D05D32711209CA51"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/256982012/16922.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://infolink2020.dk/DVT/dokumenter/doc/16922.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Veterinary Clinical Sciences, Section for Surgery, Neurology and Cardiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Michelle Brønniche Møller","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"b5e5eecb-724d-4c18-894b-4f256c61e4f0","name":"Nielsen, Michelle Brønniche Møller","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Pia","key":"sahlpau","last":"Sahl","name":"Sahl, Pia","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Ulrik","key":"westruppau","last":"Westrup","locid":"c0bd9e11-900d-4f3b-a958-379ed5b0c8da","name":"Westrup, Ulrik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lene Elisabeth","key":"buelundpau","last":"Buelund","locid":"08519bcf-e2b1-4ae0-8da9-bd7653cd8a9d","name":"Buelund, Lene Elisabeth","orcid":"0000-0002-4730-4111","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Thomas","key":"eriksenpau","last":"Eriksen","locid":"7b03cb70-58f3-4305-9c37-f51439963d7b","name":"Eriksen, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0001-5774-1166","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01066854","19023715"],"issn_org":["01066854"],"issue":"4","journal":"Dansk Veterinærtidsskrift","pages":"27-29","status":"p","title":"Dansk Veterinærtidsskrift","title_org":"Dansk Veterinaertidsskrift","volume":"2017"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-8cd31241-2e05-41d4-a1b1-988a93f3b6b1"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Migrerende fremmedlegeme i psoas muskulaturen hos en korthåret hønsehund","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-477650","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Objective: The aim of this study was to evaluate the efficacy and safety of combining irinotecan, bevacizumab, and cetuximab/panitumumab as a 4th-line treatment in patients with metastatic colorectal cancer. Methods: All patients had KRAS wild-type metastatic colorectal cancer and had previously received fluoropyrimidine, oxaliplatin, irinotecan, and cetuximab/panitumumab in a 1st, 2nd, and 3rd line setting. Most patients had previously received bevacizumab as well. All patients had progressed within 3 months after the last given treatment before starting the triple combination therapy every second week. Results: Sixty-three patients were evaluated. The triple combination therapy was well tolerated. The median progression-free survival was 6.1 months, and the median overall survival was 11.9 months. Four patients (6%) obtained a partial response, and 40 (63%) had stable disease. Conclusion: The combination of irinotecan, bevacizumab, and cetuximab/panitumumab is safe and shows a toxicity profile corresponding to what is expected from the agents alone. The results indicate that the combination in the 4th line may result in a high rate of disease control in heavily pretreated patients with metastatic colorectal cancer.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Larsen, Finn Ole","Markussen, Alice","Nielsen, Dorte Lisbet","Colville-Ebeling, Bonnie","Riis, Lene Buhl","Jensen, Benny V."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-524835"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bevacizumab","Cetuximab","EGFR inhibitor","Irinotecan","Metastatic colorectal cancer"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dual inhibition of egfr and vegf in heavily pretreated patients with metastatic colorectal cancer","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-524835","identifier":[{"id":"85020231493","type":"scopus"},{"id":"28531891","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-dc01b9be-5888-4733-9e20-e0bb2f41687f"],"keyword":["4th-line therapy","Bevacizumab","Cetuximab","EGFR inhibitor","Irinotecan","Metastatic colorectal cancer","Panitumumab"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-97F153CA05D950456533E65EFFC3288A"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Clinical Oncology","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Finn Ole","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Finn Ole","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Alice","key":"markussenpau","last":"Markussen","name":"Markussen, Alice","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Dorte","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"8bd14092-b1da-4f24-b4db-d31d38f5f1b7","name":"Nielsen, Dorte Lisbet","name_org":"Nielsen, Dorte","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Bonnie","key":"colvilleebelingpau","last":"Colville-Ebeling","name":"Colville-Ebeling, Bonnie","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lene B.","key":"riispau","last":"Riis","locid":"8ec061c0-f464-42fd-ac8d-f972f86292cd","name":"Riis, Lene Buhl","name_org":"Riis, Lene B.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Benny V.","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Benny V.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28531891"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1159/000475818","issn":["00302414","14230232"],"issn_org":["00302414"],"issue":"3","journal":"Oncology","pages":"191-196","status":"p","title":"Oncology","volume":"93"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85020231493"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-dc01b9be-5888-4733-9e20-e0bb2f41687f"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Dual Inhibition of EGFR and VEGF in Heavily Pretreated Patients with Metastatic Colorectal Cancer","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-524835","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"This presentation is based on a research project exploring carrier learning measures in Danish schools. Appr. 20 per cent of the young generation do not acquire a youth education, (neither upper secondary nor vocational degrees), which is in Denmark drawing near to a prerequisite to get access to an increasingly specialized workforce. This share has remained the same for decades, in spite of numerous initiatives. On this background recent reforms of “Folkeskolen”, (primary and lower secondary school) and of the counseling effort have extended tasks and responsibilities of schools and common teachers in the process of preparing pupils to education and work. One of recent measures is an “education-readiness-evaluation” of all 8th and 9th graders. Another recent invention is the tying up of individual pupils plans to the final education plan, thus making it possible to draw on behavior and performance from all school years when outlining a career path of each pupil. In addition, a subject named “Education and job” are to be taught from preschool till 9th grade, spanning three fields of competencies “Personal choice”, “From education to job” and “Worklife”, where “personal choice” has been given more weight in the latest regulation of the subject. On the basis of a reading of policy documents, analysis of the exchange over carrier learning in the trade journal for teacher and analysis of the teacher interviews from 5 schools the project tentatively pictures the condition for becoming ready to education and for the professional work with that issue. We ask, in a Bourdieu fashion, how do early carrier learning and evaluation of readiness structure opportunities for various pupils? Are differences and inequality reproduced, or are new patterns of in- and exclusion evolving? How do the career learning tasks fit into the professional habitus of the teacher and how are the ground for cooperation between teachers and guidance counsellors in the new division of labour between them? On this background the presentation will contribute to the identification of current challenges and opportunities in a changing landscape of schooling and counseling.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Lene Kofoed","Nielsen, Charlotte Hahn","Willaa, Katrine Cecilie Weiland","Nørgård, Christina"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-553692"],"event":{"end":"2017-10-07","place":"Padova, it","start":"2017-10-05","title":"Decent Work, Equity and Inclusion: Paswords for the present and the future.","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2023-07","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-AB"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the earlier the better when career learning starts in basic school","src":["pha"],"src-code":["DI-UC-AB"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-553692","ids":["pha-3d7e3941-81db-4cb7-a40a-7b29942fbd51"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","noi":["Local-1-1-DDE8A3BA9EA5AFD2BE3888A066147457"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"university college absalon","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-AB","l3nl":"University College Absalon","l3nn":"University College Absalon","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University College Absalon","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen Absalon, Direktionen - Slagelse, Pædagogik og Ledelsesområdet, Absalon - Forskningsprogram for Specialpædagogik og udsathed blandt børn & unge","Professionshøjskolen Absalon, Direktionen - Slagelse, Pædagogik og Ledelsesområdet, Læreruddannelsen - Roskilde"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-AB","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene Kofoed","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"26ee2f51-56be-424e-8c03-3fb38f94c44f","name":"Rasmussen, Lene Kofoed","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte Hahn","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"99d6b356-e2b6-4189-b7e2-1c509f148727","name":"Nielsen, Charlotte Hahn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Katrine Cecilie Weiland","key":"willaapau","last":"Willaa","locid":"400ffc13-2370-47e0-a225-5dc0a6416b55","name":"Willaa, Katrine Cecilie Weiland","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christina","key":"nørgårdpau","last":"Nørgård","locid":"644215dc-d31a-40b8-8959-a5b6609c2df1","name":"Nørgård, Christina","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University College Absalon","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["pha-3d7e3941-81db-4cb7-a40a-7b29942fbd51"],"src":["AB University College Absalon"],"title":"The earlier the better? When career learning starts in basic school","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-553692","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: The individual placement and support (IPS) intervention supports persons with severe mental illness in achieving competitive employment. Although the IPS intervention is labelled a recovery-oriented intervention, little is known about how participants experience IPS to influence recovery. The aim was to investigate how IPS and employment influence recovery in persons with severe mental illness. MATERIAL: A qualitative phenomenological hermeneutic study of experiences of 12 participants in IPS. DISCUSSION AND CONCLUSION: IPS and competitive work have an impact on personal recovery, may influence work functioning and decrease depressive symptoms, but do not seem to have an impact on psychotic symptoms.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Gammelgaard, Iben","Christensen, Thomas N.","Falgaard Eplov, Lene","Jensen, Sofie B.","Stenager, Elsebeth","Petersen, Kirsten Schultz"],"cuid":["S02-097.00-007214"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Adult","Clinical and personal recovery","Denmark","Diagnostic Self Evaluation","Employment","Experiences","Female","Humans","Individual placement and support","Interviews as Topic","Journal Article","Male","Mental Disorders rehabilitation","Middle Aged","Qualitative Research","Quality of Life psychology","Self esteem","Severe mental illness"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"OT":["3 Mental Health Centre Copenhagen, Copenhagen, Denmark."],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"i have potential experiences of recovery in the individual placement and support intervention","src":["aau","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"acce