{"abstract":"Afrapportering af projektet Epistemiske strategier i studieaktivitetsmodellen. Rapporten er en afrapportering af projektet Epistemiske strategier i studieaktivitetsmodellen, som har udfoldet sig gennem en vifte bestående af seks delprojekter inden for to overordnede tematikker: de studerendes hverdagsliv og praktik og praksisrelateringer. Projekterne er forankret i udvalgte professionsuddannelser med følgende temaer og nedslag:De studerendes hverdagsliv:Pædagoguddannelsen og ernærings- og sundhedsuddannelsen. (Hverdagslivsperspektiv, rutiner og brud)Praktik og praksisrelateringer:Socialrådgiveruddannelsen (Praktik og videnformer)Pædagoguddannelsen (Modul om bæredygtig pædagogik gennem praksissamarbejde)Sygeplejerskeuddannelsen (Praktik og videnformer)Ernærings- og sundhedsuddannelsen (Fremtidsværksted om studerendes forestillinger, drømme etc.)Pædagoguddannelsen (Videnforståelse, læreprocesser og didaktiske rum).","author_count":9,"contributors":["Vestbo, Michelle","Steenfeldt, Vibeke Østergaard","Helms, Niels Henrik","Storm, Helle","Hansen, Tania Erika Aniol","Schmidt, Lene Skytthe Kaarsberg","Nielsen, Tine","Månsson, Hans Bærent","Dræbel, Tania Aase"],"cuid":["S02-099.74-048040"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Fremtidsværksted","Hverdagsliv","Pædagoguddannelsen","Studerende","Studieaktivitetsmodel","Sygeplejerskeuddannelsen","Uddannelse","Uddannelse professioner og erhverv","epistemiske strategier","ernærings og sundhedsuddannelsen","portfoliopædagogik","professioner og erhverv","socialrådgiveruddannelsen","teori og praktik","videnformer"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"OT":["Vidensemergens.dk"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"],"UC":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU","DI-UC-AB"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"epistemiske strategier i studieaktivitetsmodellen 000000000009 000000002015 000000000012 000000002016","src":["pha","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU","DI-UC-AB"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/169076795/Afrapportering_Epistemeprojekt_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-099.74-048040","ids":["pha-a420079c-df0c-45ba-8031-d66720d3efb0","sdu-68d7a71c-4ab7-4761-8cc6-20a92f6443a1"],"keyword":["Uddannelse","Uddannelse, professioner og erhverv","epistemiske strategier","ernærings- og sundhedsuddannelsen","fremtidsværksted","hverdagsliv","portfoliopædagogik","professioner og erhverv","pædagoguddannelsen","socialrådgiveruddannelsen","studerende","studieaktivitetsmodel","sygeplejerskeuddannelsen","teori og praktik","videnformer"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-78551AFBA7271A9D8674526EEFBE1F3B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/169076795/Afrapportering_Epistemeprojekt_.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"university college absalon","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-AB","l3nl":"University College Absalon","l3nn":"University College Absalon","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University College Absalon","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen Absalon, Direktionen - Slagelse, Kommunikation og Ledelsessekretariat, Kommunikation og Ledelsessekretariat - Slagelse"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-AB","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Vidensemergens.dk"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":3,"key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, User Perspectives and Community-based Interventions"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU"}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michelle","key":"vestbopau","last":"Vestbo","locid":"9f58b4b1-f1f9-4704-a3ba-f17d2ac51d46","name":"Vestbo, Michelle","orcid":"0000-0003-3915-2696","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vibeke Østergaard","key":"steenfeldtpau","last":"Steenfeldt","locid":"35d304fe-506b-4578-917b-59a17c0f79b2","name":"Steenfeldt, Vibeke Oestergaard","name_org":"Steenfeldt, Vibeke Østergaard","orcid":"0000-0002-2724-6815","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels Henrik","key":"helmspau","last":"Helms","name":"Helms, Niels Henrik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Helle","key":"stormpau","last":"Storm","locid":"85e5f18c-47c2-4bfc-8c7c-39690c517326","name":"Storm, Helle","orcid":"0000-0002-4410-1183","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tania Erika Aniol","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"153050ca-b338-49d1-adf3-0d3cbdc05657","name":"Hansen, Tania Erika Aniol","orcid":"0000-0002-3952-3189","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene Skytthe Kaarsberg","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"5b66c45a-d318-4420-a6a5-5b2aeede9908","name":"Schmidt, Lene Skytthe Kaarsberg","orcid":"0000-0002-6168-6072","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tine","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"2e90260c-5002-4a2f-8155-4972898ec408","name":"Nielsen, Tine","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hans Bærent","key":"månssonpau","last":"Månsson","locid":"1071d4d5-6367-49cc-aa01-2a26aee749af","name":"Månsson, Hans Bærent","orcid":"0000-0002-1279-4675","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tania Aase","key":"dræbelpau","last":"Dræbel","locid":"16884292-d6c9-452a-8c6d-1b5c0d7ebef0","name":"Dræbel, Tania Aase","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"37","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University College Absalon","University Colleges","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["pha-a420079c-df0c-45ba-8031-d66720d3efb0","sdu-68d7a71c-4ab7-4761-8cc6-20a92f6443a1"],"src":["AB University College Absalon","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Epistemiske strategier i studieaktivitetsmodellen 09/2015 – 12/2016","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.74-048040","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE: To explore if the definition of labour market attachment (LMA) changes LMA proportions after severe traumatic brain injury (TBI). DESIGN: Cohort study with 5-year follow-up. PARTICIPANTS: Patients aged 18-64 years with severe TBI from 2004 to 2012 (n = 637) and matched controls (n = 2497). METHODS: LMA was defined in three ways. All definitions included patients working with no government benefits. Definition 2 included patients receiving unemployment benefits (LMA-unemployment benefits). Definition 3 included patients receiving supplemental benefits/services such as patients involved in work-activation schemes (LMA supplementary benefits). First week of return to work (RTW), stable LMA first year after RTW and weekly LMA prevalence were calculated. Patients and controls were compared using multivariable conditional logistic regression. RESULTS: LMA unemployment benefits had similar proportions to LMA with no benefits. These estimates were lower than LMA supplemental benefits where 52% attempted to RTW and 31% achieved stable LMA within 2 years. The maximal LMA prevalence (LMA supplementary benefits) decreased from 33 to 30% from years 2 to 5. Adjusted odds ratios were 0.05 and 0.06 for years 1 and 2, and 0.07 for stable LMA in patients compared to controls. CONCLUSION: LMA proportions differed depending on the definition. Regardless of definition, LMA proportions following severe TBI were low in Denmark.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Odgaard, Lene","Johnsen, Søren Paaske","Stubbs, Peter William","Pedersen, Asger Roer","Nielsen, Jørgen Feldbæk"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-198900"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"alternative measures reveal different but low estimates of labour market attachment after severe traumatic brain injury a nationwide cohort study","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85020268440","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-198900","identifier":[{"id":"28585861","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85020268440","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-799cd58a-a4eb-4b73-976d-b4267054616a"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-AF7DDA649D92F7F87421F3E5A7BCF4ED"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Regionshospital Hammel Neurocenter"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene","key":"odgaardpau","last":"Odgaard","locid":"1b80fe7b-ba0a-45b3-aca1-48bc19a97a44","name":"Odgaard, Lene","orcid":"0000-0002-9830-3282","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Paaske","key":"johnsenpau","last":"Johnsen","locid":"4664f7a0-39e7-4f46-9121-1c3999eb3d09","name":"Johnsen, Søren Paaske","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter William","key":"stubbspau","last":"Stubbs","locid":"1c8c090a-93cd-447a-9c67-e6ec7916a7bb","name":"Stubbs, Peter William","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Asger Roer","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a9b1b4b8-df5b-437d-a84f-fcc1778ce6eb","name":"Pedersen, Asger Roer","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen Feldbæk","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3fb25b9f-381b-44a6-a8dd-26eacf839d37","name":"Nielsen, Jørgen Feldbæk","orcid":"0000-0001-5339-171X","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28585861"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/02699052.2017.1312017","issn":["02699052","1362301X"],"issn_org":["02699052"],"issue":"10","journal":"Brain Injury","pages":"1298-1306","publisher":"Informa Healthcare","status":"p","title":"Brain Injury","volume":"31"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85020268440"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-799cd58a-a4eb-4b73-976d-b4267054616a"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Alternative measures reveal different but low estimates of labour market attachment after severe traumatic brain injury : A nationwide cohort study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-198900","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE: To determine return to work (RTW) after severe traumatic brain injury (TBI) and to compare long-term labor market attachment (LMA) with the general population. PARTICIPANTS: All persons aged 18 to 64 years who received highly specialized neurorehabilitation after severe TBI between 2004 and 2012 (n = 637) were matched to general population controls on age, sex, preinjury employment status, educational level, and residence (n = 2497). DESIGN: Nationwide follow-up study using weekly records on public assistance benefits. MAIN MEASURES: Both RTW and LMA were defined as having no public assistance benefits except education grants/leave. Stable LMA was defined as weeks with LMA of 75% or more. LMA among persons with severe TBI and controls was compared using multivariable conditional logistic regression. RESULTS: RTW mainly occurred within first 2 years after severe TBI, with 30% of the people attempting RTW and 16% achieving stable LMA within 2 years. The prevalence of people with LMA decreased to 11% from 2½ years to 5 years postinjury. Adjusted odds ratios were 0.01 for LMA up to 2 years postinjury and 0.05 for stable LMA for persons with severe TBI compared with the general population. CONCLUSION: Both RTW and long-term LMA after severe TBI were low in Denmark when compared with the general population and other countries.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Odgaard, Lene","Johnsen, Søren Paaske","Pedersen, Asger Roer","Nielsen, Jørgen Feldbæk"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-268714"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"return to work after severe traumatic brain injury a nationwide follow up study","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84975501587","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-268714","identifier":[{"id":"84975501587","type":"scopus"},{"id":"27323216","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-f4662ee6-c6c4-464e-9a64-41d62e65b0fa"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-5B1B7A82A959742894BC2BFEC26FA993"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Regionshospital Hammel Neurocenter"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene","key":"odgaardpau","last":"Odgaard","locid":"1b80fe7b-ba0a-45b3-aca1-48bc19a97a44","name":"Odgaard, Lene","orcid":"0000-0002-9830-3282","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Paaske","key":"johnsenpau","last":"Johnsen","locid":"4664f7a0-39e7-4f46-9121-1c3999eb3d09","name":"Johnsen, Søren Paaske","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Asger Roer","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"a9b1b4b8-df5b-437d-a84f-fcc1778ce6eb","name":"Pedersen, Asger Roer","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen Feldbæk","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"3fb25b9f-381b-44a6-a8dd-26eacf839d37","name":"Nielsen, Jørgen Feldbæk","orcid":"0000-0001-5339-171X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["27323216"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1097/htr.0000000000000239","issn":["08859701","1550509X"],"issn_org":["08859701"],"issue":"3","journal":"Journal of Head Trauma Rehabilitation","publisher":"Lippincott Williams and Wilkins Ltd.","status":"p","title":"Journal of Head Trauma Rehabilitation","volume":"32"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84975501587"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-f4662ee6-c6c4-464e-9a64-41d62e65b0fa"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Return to Work After Severe Traumatic Brain Injury : A Nationwide Follow-up Study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-268714","year":"2017","yearsub":"2016"}
{"author_count":2,"contributors":["Nielsen, Marie Vejrup","Kühle, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-272315"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"nyt om religion i danmark i dag","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://tidsskrift.dk/rid/article/view/26375/23182","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-272315","ids":["au-faa594e5-23c6-40fe-9e1e-65b3b696a3a7"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-1065B43B044690707E6BE8AE611D0398"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://tidsskrift.dk/rid/article/view/26375/23182","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Culture and Society, School of Culture and Society - Centre for Contemporary Religion","Aarhus University, Arts, School of Culture and Society, School of Culture and Society - Department of the Study of Religion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Marie Vejrup","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"e87a5ccd-889f-4296-8f21-21cfd2afa26d","name":"Nielsen, Marie Vejrup","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene","key":"kühlepau","last":"Kühle","locid":"a68c3965-d3a3-4e62-84dd-afd8096ce647","name":"Kühle, Lene","orcid":"0000-0001-5097-0521","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["24455024"],"issue":"1","journal":