{"abstract":"Artiklen er en analyse af receptionen af Frede P. Jensens kritik af den svenske historiker Arthur Stilles indflydelsesrige teori fra 1918 om årsagerne den svenske stormagts opståen. Stilles teori så den svenske politik som et grundlæggende defensivt og eksistentielt svar på en dansk indkredsning af Sverige, hvilket Frede P. Jensen afviste som faktuelt forkert, apologetisk og influeret af samtidens politik og monarkiske tendenser i Sverige i 1900-tallets første årtier. Artiklens konklusion er, at Stilles teorier er generelt afvist i vor tids skandinaviske historieforskning, men at der er et markant efterslæb i engelsksprogede publikationer, hvor Stilles indkredsningstese stadig lever.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Andersen, Dan H."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-550216"],"filters":{"added":"2022-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Historiografi"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-KUM"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"frede p jensen og den danske indkredsning af vasatidens sverige 000000000040 år efter","src":["kum"],"src-code":["DI-GV-KUM"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-550216","ids":["kum-989727ff-47ff-4842-ab86-6c8840e9b28a"],"keyword":["1560-1721","Arthur Stille","Frede P. Jensen","historiografi","svensk stormagtstid"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-251066E28F1788B6787DD4525AC0648A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kum ministry of culture archives museums and royal library denmark","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-KUM","l3nn":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","namevar":["Ministry of Culture Denmark, Royal Danish Library","Ministry of Culture Denmark, The Royal Library"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-KUM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Dan H.","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"1034c349-0aa9-46fd-a1df-caadc39f1dee","name":"Andersen, Dan H.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sofie Lene","key":"bakpedh","last":"Bak","name":"Bak, Sofie Lene","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Thorsten","key":"borringolesenpedh","last":"Borring Olesen","name":"Borring Olesen, Thorsten","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Lene","key":"eklundjürgensenpedh","last":"Eklund-Jürgensen","name":"Eklund-Jürgensen, Lene","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Erland","key":"koldingnielsenpedh","last":"Kolding Nielsen","name":"Kolding Nielsen, Erland","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik","key":"lundtoftepedh","last":"Lundtofte","name":"Lundtofte, Henrik","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Rasmus","key":"mariagerpedh","last":"Mariager","name":"Mariager, Rasmus","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jakob K.","key":"meilepedh","last":"Meile","name":"Meile, Jakob K.","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"edition":"1","isbn":["9788763545464"],"pages":"31-54","place":"København","publisher":"Museum Tusculanums Forlag","series":"Danish Humanist Texts and Studies","status":"p","subtitle":"Historiske &amp; kulturhistoriske studier. Festskrift til John T. Lauridsen","title":"Kildekunst","volume":"2"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","Governmental Institutions"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kum-989727ff-47ff-4842-ab86-6c8840e9b28a"],