{"abstract":"Four new yanuthone analogs (1–4) were isolated from the filamentous fungus Aspergillus niger. The structures of the new compounds were elucidated on the basis of UHPLC-DAD-HRMS data and one-dimensional and two-dimensional NMR spectroscopy. Labeling studies with 13C8-6-methylsalicylic acid identified three class I yanuthones originating from the polyketide 6-methylsalicylic acid (yanuthone K, L and M (1–3)) and a class II yanuthone, which was named yanuthone X2 (4). The four new compounds were tested toward the pathogenic yeast Candida albicans and all displayed antifungal activity. Yanuthone X2 represents the first example of a bioactive class II yanuthone, demonstrating the pharmaceutical potential of this class.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Petersen, Lene Maj","Holm, Dorte Koefoed","Knudsen, Peter Boldsen","Nielsen, Kristian Fog","Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","Mortensen, Uffe Hasbro","Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-380521"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"characterization of four new antifungal yanuthones from i aspergillus niger i","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/doi:10.1038/ja.2014.130","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-380521","identifier":[{"id":"84925595851","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-fdd64aec-094f-4323-98f4-fff62de2d269"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-2E01B962B5D26CC67624CD12885BF2FD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/doi:10.1038/ja.2014.130","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemistry","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemistry, Organic Chemistry","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene Maj","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"7a1c5a02-7eb8-40e3-a1ec-621fb3c37652","name":"Petersen, Lene Maj","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Dorte Koefoed","key":"holmpau","last":"Holm","locid":"aedc7b19-7dd8-4af4-a8cc-5a73f5783c91","name":"Holm, Dorte Koefoed","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter Boldsen","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"991df7f2-a085-49ce-a926-da127ba3b28b","name":"Knudsen, Peter Boldsen","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristian Fog","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"d2067ee9-e48c-4cf4-ac8f-ee775d8aff5a","name":"Nielsen, Kristian Fog","orcid":"0000-0002-5848-0911","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Held","key":"gotfredsenpau","last":"Gotfredsen","locid":"1cf4df84-2d0e-4693-bf47-e9932e3bf0e3","name":"Gotfredsen, Charlotte Held","orcid":"0000-0002-7386-119X","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Uffe Hasbro","key":"mortensenpau","last":"Mortensen","locid":"dec3038b-f004-4c96-84a1-52825e1c0ce8","name":"Mortensen, Uffe Hasbro","orcid":"0000-0002-7794-7273","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas Ostenfeld","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"bd958d52-71b6-4720-b30a-cc9305633b43","name":"Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld","orcid":"0000-0002-3362-5707","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1038/ja.2014.130","issn":["00218820","03682781"],"issn_org":["00218820"],"journal":"The Journal of Antibiotics","pages":"201-205","publisher":"Springer Nature","status":"p","title":"The Journal of Antibiotics","volume":"68"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84925595851"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-fdd64aec-094f-4323-98f4-fff62de2d269"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Characterization of four new antifungal yanuthones from<i> Aspergillus niger</i>","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-380521","year":"2015","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Nitrogen can be recovered from the liquid fraction of biogas digestate by air stripping in order to make concentrated fertilizers which can be transported more efficiently from an agricultural area with manure nitrogen surplus to an area where it can replace inorganic fertilizers. The product is ammonia sulfate, as sulphuric acid absorption is used to produce the concentrate in a liquid form. Process simulations are carried out to investigate the operational and capital costs of a process treating 30,000kg/h liquid digestate. Two designs with and without NaOH addition, respectively, are compared. Increased pH of the liquid digestate by NaOH addition favors NH 3 over NH 4 +, and hence increases process efficiency reducing capital costs, but increases the operational costs three times due to the cost of NaOH. Further, the total treatment cost is highly dependent on potential sales price of ammonia sulfate. Without NaOH, the treatment cost is 3.2-7.6 US$/m 3 and with 210kg/h NaOH the treatment cost is 5.2-9.6 US$/m 3.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Fjerbæk Søtoft, Lene","Pryds, Michael B","Nielsen, Anne K","Norddahl, Birgir"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-602180"],"event":{"end":"2015-06-04","place":"København, dk","start":"2015-05-31","title":"The Joint Meeting of the 12th International Symposium on Process Systems Engineering and the 25th European Symposium on Computer Aided Process Engineering","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Air stripping","Ammonia recovery","Biogas digestate","Process simulation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"process simulation of ammonia recovery from biogas digestate by air stripping with reduced chemical consumption","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/B978-0-444-63576-1.50105-9","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-602180","identifier":[{"id":"84940478453","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-654a3624-68d9-43a0-a5a1-cff55470910b"],"keyword":["Air stripping","Ammonia recovery","Biogas digestate","Process simulation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CEE6C44CA0C7B5F33E6BF1BD3C2D5558"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/B978-0-444-63576-1.50105-9","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Green Technology (IGT)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Renew Energy A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"fjerbæksøtoftpau","last":"Fjerbæk Søtoft","locid":"00447b51-640b-4b39-a5d3-baca314204fd","name":"Fjerbæk Søtoft, Lene","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael B","key":"prydspau","last":"Pryds","name":"Pryds, Michael B","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne K","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Anne K","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Birgir","key":"norddahlpau","last":"Norddahl","locid":"536a0b41-cddd-414d-950d-c064201806a0","name":"Norddahl, Birgir","orcid":"0000-0002-9423-5411","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/b978-0-444-63576-1.50105-9","issn":["15707946"],"journal":"Computer Aided Chemical Engineering","pages":"2465-2470","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Computer Aided Chemical Engineering","volume":"37"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84940478453"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","University of Southern Denmark","renew energy a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-654a3624-68d9-43a0-a5a1-cff55470910b"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Process Simulation of Ammonia Recovery from Biogas Digestate by Air Stripping with Reduced Chemical Consumption","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-602180","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"The antidepressant efficacy of isocarboxazide is well established; however, the clinical use early became restricted and today the use of isocarboxazide in Denmark is very limited. Isocarboxazide is safe when keeping a low tyramine-containing diet and avoiding concomitant treatment with certain drugs. The risk of developing oedema can be reduced by vitamin B6 treatment. Normal dosage isocarboxazide may be prescribed for all patients because isocarboxazide is not metabolized through the CYP2D6 enzyme complex like most other antidepressants. It is recommended to include isocarboxazide in the official treatment algorithms for patients who are resistant to conventional antidepressant therapy and electroconvulsive therapy.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Jens Knud","Nielsen, Lene Buch-Krogh","Brøsen, Kim"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-606776"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Antidepressive Agents administration dosage","Depressive Disorder Treatment Resistant drug therapy","Diet","Drug Interactions","Edema chemically induced","English Abstract","Humans","Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"anvendelse af monoaminooksidasehæmmeren isocarboxazid ved behandlingsresistent depression","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://ugeskriftet.dk/videnskab/V06150499","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-606776","identifier":[{"id":"26692222","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-754feb31-1f9c-459d-b8ac-801bcb54965f"],"keyword":["Antidepressive Agents/administration & dosage","Depressive Disorder, Treatment-Resistant/drug therapy","Diet","Drug Interactions","Edema/chemically induced","English Abstract","Humans","Isocarboxazid/administration & dosage","Journal Article","Monoamine Oxidase Inhibitors/administration & dosage","Tyramine/analysis","Vitamin B 6/therapeutic use"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-413C5D0730E782F30F9AC6871D6803D8"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, Psychiatry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Knud","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Jens Knud","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"kroghnielsenpau","last":"Krogh-Nielsen","locid":"4004ad2d-9e00-4d58-b314-6417f6b0de21","name":"Nielsen, Lene Buch-Krogh","name_org":"Krogh-Nielsen, Lene","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kim","key":"brøsenpau","last":"Brøsen","locid":"8c6b2aeb-e594-4852-89a1-285b9a944557","name":"Brøsen, Kim","orcid":"0000-0001-8444-7835","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26692222"],"pub":{"issn":["00415782","13994174"],"issn_org":["00415782"],"journal":"Ugeskrift for Læger","publisher":"Lægeforeningen","status":"p","title":"Ugeskrift for Læger","volume":"177"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-754feb31-1f9c-459d-b8ac-801bcb54965f"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Anvendelse af monoaminooksidasehæmmeren isocarboxazid ved behandlingsresistent depression","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-606776","year":"2015","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"The purpose of this study was to examine if the over-the-counter herbal medicinal plant St. John's wort affects glucose tolerance in healthy men. To do this, we included 10 healthy men who were examined by a 2-hr oral glucose tolerance test on three occasions; A: Baseline, B: After 21 days treatment with St. John's wort and C: At least 6 weeks after the last capsule of St. John's wort was ingested. Plasma glucose, serum insulin and C-peptide levels were measured during an oral glucose tolerance test and used for estimation of area under the concentration-time curve (AUC) as well as and indices of insulin sensitivity and insulin secretion. We found that treatment with St. John's wort increased total and incremental glucose AUC and 2-hr plasma glucose levels. Surprisingly, this effect was sustained and even further increased 6 weeks after the last capsule of St. John's wort was taken. No effect on indices of insulin sensitivity was seen, but indices of insulin secretion were reduced even after adjustment for insulin sensitivity. In conclusion, this study indicates that long-term treatment with St. John's wort may impair glucose tolerance by reducing insulin secretion in young, healthy men. The unregulated use of this over-the-counter drug might be a risk factor for impaired glucose tolerance and type 2 diabetes. This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Stage, Tore Bjerregaard","Damkier, Per","Christensen, Mette Marie Hougaard","Nielsen, Lene Buch-Krogh","Højlund, Kurt","Brøsen, Kim"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-620360"],"event":{"end":"2015-06-30","place":"Madrid, es","start":"2015-06-27","title":"European Association of Clinical Pharmacology and Therapeutics","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"st john s wort impairs glucose tolerance by reducing insulin response in healthy men","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.clinthera.2015.05.037","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-620360","ids":["sdu-a4bbd85b-599d-4e1b-9e39-e609073f7815"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-C16C90C90C1B8FB2DA7DFA1390CC569B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.clinthera.2015.05.037","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, Clinical Pharmacology and Pharmacy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tore Bjerregaard","key":"stagepau","last":"Stage","locid":"b794c141-d9c5-4082-b8c5-b69f854d4c7c","name":"Stage, Tore Bjerregaard","orcid":"0000-0002-4698-4389","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Per","key":"damkierpau","last":"Damkier","locid":"e254325b-c1ab-405c-a1cc-00b299596c9a","name":"Damkier, Per","orcid":"0000-0003-0591-7187","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette Marie Hougaard","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"0e57041e-ccc2-49af-af5a-e76d0d29d2f8","name":"Christensen, Mette Marie Hougaard","orcid":"0000-0001-9797-276X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene Buch-Krogh","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"4004ad2d-9e00-4d58-b314-6417f6b