{"abstract":"Videoen er en evaluering af arbejdet med en metodisk tilgang til kollegial supervision på VIA Ergoterapeutuddannelsen gennem et par år. Evalueringen sætter fokus på selve metoden, der er anvendt til kollegial supervision. Derudover er der fokus på erfaringer og udbytte af at arbejde systematisk med kollegial supervision blandt undervisere på VIA Ergoterapeutuddannelsen.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Petersen, Anne Line Bjerre Folsgaard","Bager, Lene Tortzen","Jørgensen, Mette Eg","Nielsen, Marianne Lyngmose","Hansen, Pia Even"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-659696"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Evaluering","kollegial supervision"],"level":"pop","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"evaluering af kollegial supervision via ergoterapeutuddannelsen aarhus maj 000000002015","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-659696","ids":["via-a9e6eaf3-ae91-4f74-9ced-f09adf979a72"],"keyword":["evaluering","kollegial supervision"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","noi":["Local-1-1-DA5B6DF4FB3F5E304D176B3947F6172C"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Uddannelser, Sundhedsuddannelserne, Ergoterapeutuddannelsen Aarhus N"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aa