{"abstract":"Produktivitetskommissionens anbefalinger diskuteres kritisk i lyset af den nye forskning på feltet. Fokus er på, om der er noget nyt under solen, eller om der er tale om gammel vin på nye flasker, når man anbefaler at koble tydelig ledelse med motivation og trivsel, og at koble kompetencer med præstationer og løn?","author_count":5,"contributors":["Andersen, Lotte Bøgh","Pedersen, Lene Holm","Westergård-Nilesen, Niels"],"cuid":["S02-080.36-031943"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-VIVE"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-VIVE","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ledelse belønning og præstationer version 000000000002 000000000000","src":["cbs","vive"],"src-code":["DI-GV-VIVE","DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.djoef-forlag.dk/openaccess/samf/samfdocs/2015/2015_2/samf_2015_2_2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-080.36-031943","ids":["cbs-af6d6db6-cb15-41e9-8232-e898cf125e15","vive-ceeeb76c-d92a-450b-afd6-c7b5f9052004"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-4-A1F6E7B490537B21F17AC627028675B3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.djoef-forlag.dk/openaccess/samf/samfdocs/2015/2015_2/samf_2015_2_2.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"vive the danish center for social science research","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-VIVE","l3nn":"VIVE The Danish Center for Social Science Research","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordi