{"abstract":"This report is Denmark’s National Inventory Report 2014. The report contains information on Denmark’s emission inventories for all years’ from 1990 to 2012 for CO2, CH4, N2O, HFCs, PFCs and SF6, NOx, CO, NMVOC, SO2","author_count":21,"contributors":["Nielsen, Ole-Kenneth","Plejdrup, Marlene Schmidt","Winther, Morten","Nielsen, Malene","Gyldenkærne, Steen","Mikkelsen, Mette Hjorth","Albrektsen, Rikke","Thomsen, Marianne","Hjelgaard, Katja Hossy","Hoffmann, Leif","Fauser, Patrik","Bruun, Henrik Gundorph","Johannsen, Vivian Kvist","Nord-Larsen, Thomas","Vesterdal, Lars","Møller, Inge Stupak","Caspersen, Ole Hjort","Rasmussen, Erik","Petersen, Susanne Bødtker","Baunbæk, Lene","Hansen, Maria Gunnleivsdóttir"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-825776"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["CO2","Emission inventory","Greenhouse gases","Kyoto Protocol","UNFCCC"],"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"denmark s national inventory report 000000002014 emission inventories 000000001990 000000002012 submitted under the united nations framework convention on climate change and the kyoto protocol","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR101.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-825776","ids":["au-8ebd453b-9c76-4056-97b9-414210743805"],"keyword":["CO2","Emission inventory","Greenhouse gases","Kyoto Protocol","UNFCCC"],"lang":"English","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-4D345DB137112129B36D9C001E542589"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR101.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno"