{"abstract":"Work is known to be one of the main sources of human identity. It might be threatened when ill-health impairs individual labour market participation. Vocational rehabilitation, which is based on the bio-psycho-social model of health and function, is the systematic approach to improve employability for those who suffer from health-related disabilities. This article gives a short historical overview about vocational rehabilitation in Denmark, describes the current structural and political framework and gives practice examples of local multidisciplinary and intersectoral rehabilitation efforts.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Labriola, Merete","Thielen, Karsten","Eplov, Lene Falgaard","Nielsen, Claus Vinther"],"cuid":["S02-096.43-025616"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Funktionsevne","Genoptræning","Rehabilitering"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"arbejdsrettet rehabilitering","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ugeskriftet.dk/files/ugeskriftet.dk/artikel_10661.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-096.43-025616","identifier":[{"id":"85040608188","type":"scopus"},{"id":"25096745","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-b1890891-5db6-4708-a62d-9a138f409a49","ku-28acd6cf-40e2-4cdf-9bc6-9fdf8c5401bc"],"keyword":["funktionsevne","genoptræning","rehabilitering"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-4-7-8EFCFC2668E5C2914602B1E3CFF851F1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ugeskriftet.dk/files/ugeskriftet.dk/artikel_10661.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"