Smed","key":"grønkjærpau","last":"Grønkjær","name":"Grønkjær, Louise Smed","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Trine Rune Høgh","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Trine Rune Høgh","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Dorthe Vilstrup","key":"tomsenpau","last":"Tomsen","name":"Tomsen, Dorthe Vilstrup","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Tanja Joest","key":"væverpau","last":"Væver","name":"Væver, Tanja Joest","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["00415782","13994174"],"issn_org":["00415782"],"journal":"Ugeskrift for Læger","paperid":"V11130639","publisher":"Lægeforeningen","status":"p","title":"Ugeskrift for Læger","volume":"176"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-81253c54-eff3-40cb-95e9-51441f0e70d6"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Udvikling af patientspecifikke begreber vedrørende medicin er en udfordring for alle sundhedsprofessionelle","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-755443","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
