{"abstract":"Collagenous sprue is a rare clinicopathological condition of the small bowel. It is characterised by abnormal subepithelial collagen deposition and is typically associated with malabsorption, diarrhoea and weight loss. The clinical features of collagenous sprue often resemble those of coeliac disease and together with frequent histological findings like mucosal thinning and intraepithelial lymphocytosis the diagnosis may be hard to reach without awareness of this condition. While coeliac disease is treated using gluten restriction, collagenous sprue is, however, not improved by this intervention. In cases of diet-refractory 'coeliac disease' it is therefore essential to consider collagenous sprue to initiate treatment at an early stage to prevent the fibrotic progression. Here, we report a case of a 78-year-old man with collagenous sprue and present the clinical and histological manifestations as well as the successful treatment course that he underwent.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Soendergaard, Christoffer","Riis, Lene Buhl","Nielsen, Ole Haagen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-523458"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Aged","Budesonide","Calcium","Celiac disease","Collagenous Sprue","Diagnosis Differential","Dietary Supplements","Glucocorticoids","Humans","Male","Vitamin D","Vitamins"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"collagenous sprue a coeliac disease look alike with different treatment strategy","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bcr-2014-203721","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-523458","identifier":[{"id":"24682141","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84898669529","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC3975519","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-d9a5f17d-08bf-4f19-8089-5da3eff11a6c"],"keyword":["Aged","Budesonide","Calcium","Celiac Disease","Collagenous Sprue","Diagnosis, Differential","Dietary Supplements","Glucocorticoids","Humans","Male","Vitamin D","Vitamins"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B9F820552A361C37898C465364A81C2C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bcr-2014-203721","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Christoffer","key":"soendergaardpau","last":"Soendergaard","name":"Soendergaard, Christoffer","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lene Buhl","key":"riispau","last":"Riis","locid":"8ec061c0-f464-42fd-ac8d-f972f86292cd","name":"Riis, Lene Buhl","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Ole Haagen","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"d59658c4-dde8-4749-9b5c-f4ec5910dd02","name":"Nielsen, Ole Haagen","orcid":"0000-0003-4612-8635","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24682141"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1136/bcr-2014-203721","issn":["1757790X"],"journal":"BMJ Case Reports","status":"p","title":"BMJ Case Reports","volume":"2014"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84898669529"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-d9a5f17d-08bf-4f19-8089-5da3eff11a6c"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Collagenous sprue : a coeliac disease look-alike with different treatment strategy","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-523458","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
