n, Bent","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Mikkel","key":"nørresletpau","last":"Nørreslet","name":"Nørreslet, Mikkel","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Birgit Weinreich","key":"raskpau","last":"Rask","name":"Rask, Birgit Weinreich","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Susanne Overmark","key":"bendixenpau","last":"Bendixen","name":"Bendixen, Susanne Overmark","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Lene","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Lene","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Karina","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","name":"Madsen, Karina","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lotte Stig","key":"nørgaardpau","last":"Nørgaard","locid":"7dbf5d7d-7d8c-4260-b41c-0446c7cc7740","name":"Nørgaard, Lotte Stig","orcid":"0000-0002-3490-0475","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Linda Rask Westergaard","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Linda Rask Westergaard","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"47","place":"København","status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-e44ef0c2-387c-4014-9e62-82fe3e8bee35"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Evaluering af medicingennemgangsindsatsen på københavnske plejecentre i efteråret 2013","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-529736","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Introduction: A variety of preanalytical parameters may have a crucial impact on the quality of laboratory results. Earlier studies have shown both exercise and positional changes prior to the blood sampling affects different biochemical parameters. However, in relation to outpatient laboratory blood sampling both hospital administrators as well as patients has expressed a wish for cutting down waiting time. Therefore the evidence whether to recommend a standardized period of rest before collection of blood samples has been challenged. Objectives: To investigate the effect of rest time prior to blood sampling in a routine outpatient setting on common biochemical parameters – here presenting results from thyreotropin. Methods: Consecutive patients above the age of 20 referred to an outpatient clinic for blood sampling were included from January 2013 to December 2013. For each patient arrival time and time of blood sampling were registered electronically using Q-MATIC Suite. The impact of waiting time on thyreotropin value was analyzed using a simple linear regression. Results: A total of 8.712 blood samples were included in the study. The regression coefficients for individuals waiting 0-20 min, 21- 40 min and 41-60 min were -0.033 (P=0.0175, n=4,546), -0.030 (P=0.0163, n=3,501) and 0.015 (P=0,3149, n=665), respectively. Conclusion: The current pilot study shows a statistically significant effect of waiting time prior to blood sampling on thyreotropin values. Further analyses will aim to explore if this could lead to clinical misclassification. Furthermore, analysis on other biochemical parameters will be performed and based on these results decisions on whether to recommend a standardized period of rest prior to blood sampling will be taken.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Bøgh Andersen, Ida","Brasen, Claus Lohman","Christensen, Henry","Nøhr-Jensen, Lene","Nielsen, Dorthe E.","Brandslund, Ivan","Skov Madsen, Jonna"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-587593"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"effect of resting time prior to blood sampling on common biochemical parameters results from thyreotropin and albumin","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-587593","ids":["sdu-323f24c1-5947-4c64-a67b-ff7ead3d8549"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-88B58E11E8F47630C12B1CCF68B83E19"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, IRS - Lillebælt Hospital, Research Unit of Biochemistry and Immunology (Vejle)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Kolding Sygehus"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ida","key":"bøghandersenpau","last":"Bøgh Andersen","locid":"a2b62a43-cbfb-4a37-84e3-664c695a8b96","name":"Bøgh Andersen, Ida","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Claus Lohman","key":"brasenpau","last":"Brasen","locid":"beca93c9-b25f-44f8-aeac-336a55cf3e7f","name":"Brasen, Claus Lohman","orcid":"0000-0001-8654-2449","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henry","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"ed0d0824-1937-4a8c-ae21-8aa9ec01c9a2","name":"Christensen, Henry","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"nøhrjensenpau","last":"Nøhr-Jensen","locid":"2bfb7867-0beb-4008-a970-7f2cf6075bd3","name":"Nøhr-Jensen, Lene","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Dorthe E.","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Dorthe E.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ivan","key":"brandslundpau","last":"Brandslund","locid":"a81731b6-2c07-4eb3-8f89-3da6650c226b","name":"Brandslund, Ivan","orcid":"0000-0002-4203-5442","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonna","key":"skovmadsenpau","last":"Skov Madsen","name":"Skov Madsen, Jonna","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-323f24c1-5947-4c64-a67b-ff7ead3d8549"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Effect of resting time prior to blood sampling on common biochemical parameters - results from thyreotropin and albumin","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-587593","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"The Personas technique has been promoted as a strong tool for providing software developers with a better understanding of the prospective users of their software. This paper reports from a questionnaire survey regarding knowledge about Personas and their usage in software development companies. The questionnaire survey was conducted in a limited geographical area to establish the extent of Personas usage within all companies in the chosen region and determine whether software development companies used Personas during the development process. Several issues were identified as reasons for either not using the technique or for poor application of it. The study showed that 55% of the respondents had never heard about Personas. Among those who had heard about the Personas technique, the following obstacles towards usage of the technique were identified: Lack of knowledge of the technique, lack of resources (time and funding), Sparse descriptions - when applied and Personas not being integrated in the development.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Billestrup, Jane","Stage, Jan","Nielsen, Lene","Hansen, Kira S."],"cuid":["S02-081.98-002527"],"event":{"acronym":"ACHI","end":"2014-03-27","place":"Barcelona, es","start":"2014-03-23","title":"7th International Conference on Advances in Computer-Human Interactions, ACHI 2014","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Grounded theory","Obstacles to Adoption","Personas","Questionnaire survey","Software development","User Understanding"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"persona usage in software development advantages and obstacles","src":["aau","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=84921334358&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-081.98-002527","identifier":[{"id":"84921334358","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-32d0e664-2502-4fd1-88e2-c2b2d8154f89","itu-5d43e32b-2caa-4d5b-84db-166db465c153"],"keyword":["Grounded theory","Obstacles to Adoption","Personas","Questionnaire survey","Software development","User Understanding"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-D93D8E4C76A0A3C47D2CE9AFAD709D4C"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Research Centre for Socio-Interactive Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jane","key":"billestruppau","last":"Billestrup","locid":"314ec179-6966-4367-9287-0a5e6c48a6b3","name":"Billestrup, Jane","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"stagepau","last":"Stage","locid":"bfb986dc-20bc-4ff4-acd3-322363bfaedb","name":"Stage, Jan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","k