{"abstract":"To consider associations between the latest/nadir CD4 cell count, and time spent with CD4 cell count less than 200 cells/μl (duration of immune depression), and myocardial infarction (MI), coronary heart disease (CHD), stroke, or cardiovascular disease (CVD) (CHD or stroke) in 33 301 HIV-positive individuals.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Sabin, Caroline A.","Nielsen, Lene Ryom","De Wit, Stephane","Mocroft, Amanda","Phillips, Andrew N","Worm, Signe W","Weber, Rainer","D'Arminio Monforte, Antonella","Reiss, Peter","Kamara, David","El-Sadr, Wafaa","Pradier, Christian","Dabis, Francois","Law, Matthew","Lundgren, Jens"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-396336"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University College London"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"associations between immune depression and cardiovascular events in hiv infection","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1097/01.aids.0000432457.91228.f3","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-396336","identifier":[{"id":"23842128","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84888304272","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-04cce5b9-04b8-49ce-9188-cdfe7a361dc5"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3544BE41735181626F9C32B7CBE080F2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1097/01.aids.0000432457.91228.f3","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"gb","key":"university college london","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, 