{"abstract":"Denne rapport beskriver de første resultater fra den kvalitative del af et forskningsprojekt om frafald og fastholdelse i dansk erhvervsuddannelse finansieret af Det Strategiske Forskningsråd i perioden 2009-2012. Resultaterne bygger på de første elevinterview gennemført i efteråret 2009 og fokuserer eksplicit på elevernes oplevelse af eget engagement eller mangel på samme på erhvervsskolernes grundforløb.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Koudahl, Peter","Klaus, Nielsen","Pedersen, Lene Tanggaard","Munk, Martin David","Jørgensen, Christian Helms"],"cuid":["S02-082.35-048261"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Studerende"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"OT":["Aalborg Universitetsforlag"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-RUC","DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"frafald og engagement foreløbige resultater den kvalitative del","src":["kp","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC","DI-UC-KP"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://psy.au.dk/fileadmin/Psykologi/Forskning/Forskningsprojekter/Fastholdelse_af_erhvervsskoleelever/Rapport_frafald_og_engagement_finale290813.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-082.35-048261","ids":["kp-3075e60d-2685-4907-90a8-7dedd438a185","ruc-5d67f0b7-a358-4c1e-a81b-cffd8b981328"],"keyword":["studerende"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-2-6EA2FA5C49101BA8876454C56CFAA0E2"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, The Research Group in 'Working Life and Learning'","Roskilde University, The Department of Psychology and Educational Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Institut for Pædagogisk EVU, NCE IDV og tilskudprojekter (ophørt)","Københavns Professionshøjskole, Nationalt center for Erhvervspædagogik, Nationalt center for Erhvervspædagogik"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus Univeristy Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Aalborg Universitetsforlag"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Christian Helms","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"7ff8b054-f6fb-44e3-9147-91b2ed185dab","name":"Jørgensen, Christian Helms","orcid":"0000-0003-2521-7823","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"koudahlpau","last":"Koudahl","locid":"29df1cf1-8b26-4bf5-8d9e-159ec8795df0","name":"Koudahl, Peter","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"Lene Tanggaard","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Lene Tanggaard","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Nielsen","key":"klauspau","last":"Klaus","name":"Klaus, Nielsen","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Klaus","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Klaus","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin David","key":"munkpau","last":"Munk","name":"Munk, Martin David","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"67","place":"Århus","publisher":"Aarhus Universitet","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","All University Colleges","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","Hospitals","KP","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Roskilde University","Universities","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kp-3075e60d-2685-4907-90a8-7dedd438a185","ruc-5d67f0b7-a358-4c1e-a81b-cffd8b981328"],"src":["KP University College Copenhagen","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Frafald og engagement : Foreløbige resultater. Den kvalitative del","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-082.35-048261","year":2013,"yearsub":2013}
{"abstract":"Background. Several antiretroviral agents (ARVs) are associated with chronic renal impairment, but the extent of such adverse events among human immunodeficiency virus (HIV)-positive persons with initially normal renal function is unknown.Methods. D:A:D study participants with an estimated glomerular filtration rate (eGFR) of ≥90 mL/min after 1 January 2004 were followed until they had a confirmed eGFR of ≤70 mL/min (the threshold below which we hypothesized that renal interventions may begin to occur) or ≤60 mL/min (a value indicative of moderately severe chronic kidney disease [CKD]) or until the last eGFR measurement during follow-up. An eGFR was considered confirmed if it was detected at 2 consecutive measurements ≥3 months apart. Predictors and eGFR-related ARV discontinuations were identified using Poisson regression.Results. Of 22 603 persons, 468 (2.1%) experienced a confirmed eGFR of ≤70 mL/min (incidence rate, 4.78 cases/1000 person-years of follow-up [95% confidence interval \"CI\", 4.35-5.22]) and 131 (0.6%) experienced CKD (incidence rate, 1.33 cases/1000 person-years of follow-up [95% CI, 1.10-1.56]) during a median follow-up duration of 4.5 years (interquartile range [IQR], 2.7-6.1 years). A current eGFR of 60-70 mL/min caused significantly higher rates of discontinuation of tenofovir (adjusted incidence rate ratio [aIRR], 1.72 [95% CI, 1.38-2.14]) but not other ARVs compared with a current eGFR of ≥90 mL/min. Cumulative tenofovir use (aIRR, 1.18/year [95% CI, 1.12-1.25]) and ritonavir-boosted atazanavir use (aIRR, 1.19/year [95% CI, 1.09-1.32]) were independent predictors of a confirmed eGFR of ≤70 but were not significant predictors of CKD whereas ritonavir-boosted lopinavir use was a significant predictor for both end points (aIRR, 1.11/year [95% CI, 1.05-1.17] and 1.22/year [95% CI, 1.16-1.28], respectively). Associations were unaffected by censoring for concomitant ARV use but diminished after discontinuation of these ARVs.Conclusions. Tenofovir, ritonavir-boosted atazanavir, and ritonavir-boosted lopinavir use were independent predictors of chronic renal impairment in HIV-positive persons without preexisting renal impairment. Increased tenofovir discontinuation rates with decreasing eGFR may have prevented further deteriorations. After discontinuation, the ARV-associated incidence rates decreased. © 2013 The Author.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Ryom, Lene","Mocroft, Amanda","Kirk, Ole","Worm, Signe Westring","Kamara, David A","Reiss, Peter","Ross, Michael","Fux, Christoph A","Morlat, Philippe","Moranne, Olivier","Smith, Colette","Lundgren, Jens","Pedersen, Court"],"cuid":["S02-083.45-043308"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corpau":["D:A:D Study Group"],"country":["France","Netherlands","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","CHU de Bordeaux","CHU de Nice","University College London","University of Amsterdam"],"keyword":["Adult","Anti Retroviral Agents","Art","Atazanavir","Chronic kidney disease","Cohort Studies","EGFR","Female","Glomerular Filtration Rate","HIV","HIV Infections","Humans","Incidence","Lopinavir","Male","Middle Aged","Nephrotoxicity","Prospective Studies","Renal Insufficiency","Tenofovir","Withholding Treatment"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["IT Service"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"association between antiretroviral exposure and renal impairment among hiv positive persons with normal baseline renal function the d a d study sup a sup","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/infdis/jit043",