{"abstract":": The authors hypothesized that the adductor canal block (ACB), a predominant sensory blockade, reduces quadriceps strength compared with placebo (primary endpoint, area under the curve, 0.5-6 h), but less than the femoral nerve block (FNB; secondary endpoint). Other secondary endpoints were adductor strength and ability to ambulate.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Jæger, Pia Therese","Nielsen, Zbigniew Jerzy Koscielniak","Henningsen, Lene Marianne","Hilsted, Karen Lisa","Mathiesen, Ole","Dahl, Jørgen Berg"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-484665"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"adductor canal block versus femoral nerve block and quadriceps strength a randomized double blind placebo controlled crossover study in healthy volunteers","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1097/ALN.0b013e318279fa0b","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-484665","identifier":[{"id":"23241723","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84872876873","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-988fdc2d-cf0c-4386-b02e-7f784b77c31e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-63B08EE270A45C6BFD275CD24D6364AC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1097/ALN.0b013e318279fa0b","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Pia Therese","key":"jægerpau","last":"Jæger","locid":"b503b5f6-ae9c-4b8a-b93e-6c4ca6670720","name":"Jæger, Pia Therese","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Zbigniew Jerzy Koscielniak","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"09dd0fdc-41a5-4a0d-88e9-6b839936dd65","name":"Nielsen, Zbigniew Jerzy Koscielniak","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lene Marianne","key":"henningsenpau","last":"Henningsen","locid":"0565f0ca-e827-4f9a-a92e-54ecd6df5f79","name":"Henningsen, Lene Marianne","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Karen Lisa","key":"hilstedpau","last":"Hilsted","locid":"168107e5-2743-48dd-b56d-29c2781547ef","name":"Hilsted, Karen Lisa","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ole","key":"mathiesenpau","last":"Mathiesen","name":"Mathiesen, Ole","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jørgen B","key":"dahlpau","last":"Dahl","locid":"82ade23f-64a8-4cf4-9462-51b090ef3071","name":"Dahl, Jørgen Berg","name_org":"Dahl, Jørgen B","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23241723"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1097/aln.0b013e318279fa0b","issn":["07474679"],"issue":"2","journal":"Anesthesiology News","pages":"409-15","status":"p","title":"Anesthesiology News","volume":"118"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84872876873"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-988fdc2d-cf0c-4386-b02e-7f784b77c31e"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Adductor Canal Block versus Femoral Nerve Block and Quadriceps Strength : A Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled, Crossover Study in Healthy Volunteers","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-484665","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"This work investigates a novel way of looking at the regions in the brain and their relationship as possible markers to classify normal control (NC), mild cognitive impaired (MCI), and Alzheimer Disease (AD) subjects. MRI scans from a subset of 101 subjects from the ADNI study at baseline was used for this study. 40 regions in the brain including hippocampus, amygdala, thalamus, white, and gray matter were segmented using Free Surfer. From this data, we calculated the distance between the center of mass of each region, the normalized number of voxels and the percentage volume and surface connectivity shared between the regions. These markers were used for classification using a linear discriminant analysis in a leave-one-out manner. We found that the percentage of surface and volume connectivity between regions gave a significant classification between NC and AD and borderline significant between MCI and AD even after correction for whole brain volume at baseline. The results show that the morphometric connectivity markers include more information than whole brain volume or distance markers. This suggests that one can gain additional information by combining morphometric connectivity markers with traditional volume and shape markers.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Erleben, Lene Lillemark","Sørensen, Lauge","Mysling, Peter","Pai, Akshay Sadananda Uppinakudru","Dam, Erik B.","Nielsen, Mads"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-522202"],"event":{"end":"2013-02-12","place":"Lake Buena Vista, us","start":"2013-02-10","title":"Medical Imaging 2013","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-BIMQ"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-BIMQ","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"morphometric connectivity analysis to distinguish normal mild cognitive impaired and alzheimer subjects based on brain mri","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-522202","identifier":[{"id":"84878339350","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-d786e8cc-0bac-4677-9fc4-004ef736544a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5D5488235FD44971DF5DEF2A764E56B7"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"biomediq","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-BIMQ","l3nl":"Biomediq","l3nn":"Biomediq","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Biomediq","namevar":["Biomediq A/S (Biz)"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-BIMQ","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Lene Lillemark","key":"erlebenpau","last":"Erleben","locid":"0e3ad371-b61c-4c7c-b26c-605c583bbb40","name":"Erleben, Lene Lillemark","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lauge","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"330d1478-c602-4767-8d45-30063bff33ea","name":"Sørensen, Lauge","orcid":"0000-0002-1181-7150","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Peter","key":"myslingpau","last":"Mysling","locid":"f07749fa-c5e6-45f7-9d3c-485d27b2788c","name":"Mysling, Peter","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Akshay Sadananda Uppinakudru","key":"paipau","last":"Pai","locid":"2a07c27f-433e-456a-8b47-984c22cf325f","name":"Pai, Akshay Sadananda Uppinakudru","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Erik B.","key":"dampau","last":"Dam","name":"Dam, Erik B.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Mads","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"52f8d6fb-fd83-4d11-ad65-3e183ca401f2","name":"Nielsen, Mads","orcid":"0000-0003-1535-068X","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sebastien","key":"ourselinpedh","last":"Ourselin","name":"Ourselin, Sebastien","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"David R.","key":"haynorpedh","last":"Haynor","name":"Haynor, David R.","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1117/12.2007600","isbn":["9780819494436"],"issn":["16057422"],"issue":"36","publisher":"SPIE - International Society for Optical Engineering","series":"Progress in Biomedical Optics and Imaging","status":"p","subtitle":"image processing","title":"Medical Imaging 2013"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84878339350"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","Biomediq","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Private Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-d786e8cc-0bac-4677-9fc4-004ef736544a"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Morphometric connectivity analysis to distinguish normal, mild cognitive impaired, and Alzheimer subjects based on brain MRI","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-522202","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"author_count":3,"contributors":["Floris, Lene","Nielsen, Poul Otto","Sass, Julie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-552797"],"filters":{"added":"2022-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-KUM"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"skabt af tiden forhistorien og kunsten","src":["kum"],"src-code":["DI-GV-KUM"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-552797","ids":["kum-fad9b6a5-da0c-4d23-9086-95b924067a8f"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-CBE7A490107703AB3E9F779F62D18750"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kum ministry of culture archives museums and royal library denmark","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-KUM","l3nn":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","namevar":["Ministry of Culture Denmark, The National Museum of Denmark, Forskning og Formidling, Sekretariat"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-KUM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene","key":"florispau","last":"Floris","locid":"00f9b3f6-a584-4933-883f-f5098f8ffd7c","name":"Floris, Lene","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Poul Otto","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"ea96a384-1005-49d3-a159-739ec6bd6af3","name":"Nielsen, Poul Otto","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Julie","key":"sasspau","last":"Sass","name":"Sass, Julie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["00849308"],"journal":"Nationalmuseets Arbejdsmark","pages":"38-53","publisher":"Nationalmuseet","status":"p","title":"Nationalmuseets Arbejdsmark","volume":"2013"},"review":"Peer R