f menthol on cold allodynia and wind-up-like pain in upper limb amputees with different levels of phantom limb pain","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-010691","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
