{"abstract":"Chromatin Immuno Precipitation (ChIP) profiling detects in vivo protein-DNA binding, and has revealed a large combinatorial complexity in the binding of chromatin associated proteins and their post-translational modifications. To fully explore the spatial and combinatorial patterns in ChIP-profiling data and detect potentially meaningful patterns, the areas of enrichment must be aligned and clustered, which is an algorithmically and computationally challenging task. We have developed CATCHprofiles, a novel tool for exhaustive pattern detection in ChIP profiling data. CATCHprofiles is built upon a computationally efficient implementation for the exhaustive alignment and hierarchical clustering of ChIP profiling data. The tool features a graphical interface for examination and browsing of the clustering results. CATCHprofiles requires no prior knowledge about functional sites, detects known binding patterns “ab initio”, and enables the detection of new patterns from ChIP data at a high resolution, exemplified by the detection of asymmetric histone and histone modification patterns around H2A.Z-enriched sites. CATCHprofiles' capability for exhaustive analysis combined with its ease-of-use makes it an invaluable tool for explorative research based on ChIP profiling data. CATCHprofiles and the CATCH algorithm run on all platforms and is available for free through the CATCH website: http://catch.cmbi.ru.nl/. User support is available by subscribing to the mailing list catch-users@bioinformatics.org.","author_count":6,"contributors":["G. G. Nielsen, Fiona","Galschiøt Markus, Kasper","Møllegaard Friborg, Rune","Favrholdt, Lene Monrad","G. Stunnenberg, Hendrik","Huynen, Martijn"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-599809"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Radboud University Nijmegen"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"catchprofiles clustering and alignment tool for chip profiles","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84855415240","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-599809","identifier":[{"id":"84855415240","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-5ce8245b-095f-4894-8183-409d2167ad5e"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-11CE55C28ED7C5CEA7811E3F9DD17EC3"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"nl","key":"radboud university nijmegen","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Radboud University Nijmegen","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Science, Department of Mathematics and Computer Science","SDU, Faculty of Science, Department of Mathematics and Computer Science, Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Fiona","key":"ggnielsenpau","last":"G. G. Nielsen","name":"G. G. Nielsen, Fiona","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Kasper","key":"galschiøtmarkuspau","last":"Galschiøt Markus","name":"Galschiøt Markus, Kasper","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rune","key":"møllegaardfriborgpau","last":"Møllegaard Friborg","name":"Møllegaard Friborg, Rune","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lene Monrad","key":"favrholdtpau","last":"Favrholdt","locid":"d839a76b-0497-4d24-a043-33a978f793c8","name":"Favrholdt, Lene Monrad","orcid":"0000-0003-3054-2997","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hendrik","key":"gstunnenbergpau","last":"G. Stunnenberg","name":"G. Stunnenberg, Hendrik","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martijn","key":"huynenpau","last":"Huynen","name":"Huynen, Martijn","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1371/journal.pone.0028272","issn":["19326203"],"issue":"1","journal":"PLOS ONE","publisher":"Public Library of Science","status":"p","title":"PLOS ONE","volume":"7"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84855415240"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-5ce8245b-095f-4894-8183-409d2167ad5e"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"CATCHprofiles: Clustering and Alignment Tool for ChIP Profiles","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-599809","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"This report is Denmark’s National Inventory Report 2012. The report contains information on Denmark’s emission inventories for all years’ from 1990 to 2010 for CO2, CH4, N2O, HFCs, PFCs and SF6, NOx, CO, NMVOC, SO2","author_count":25,"contributors":["Nielsen, Ole-Kenneth","Mikkelsen, Mette Hjorth","Hoffmann, Leif","Gyldenkærne, Steen","Winther, Morten","Nielsen, Malene","Fauser, Patrik","Thomsen, Marianne","Plejdrup, Marlene Schmidt","Albrektsen, Rikke","Hjelgaard, Katja Hossy","Bruun, Henrik Gundorph","Johannsen, Vivian Kvist","Nord-Larsen, Thomas","Bastrup-Birk, Annemarie","Vesterdal, Lars","Møller, Inge Stupak","Rasmussen, Erik","Arfaoui, Karim","Baunbæk, Lene","Hansen, Maria Gunnleivsdóttir"],"cuid":["S03-089.83-672719"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic"],"country":["Faroe Islands","Greenland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Statistics Greenland","Umhvørvisstovan","Umhvørvistovan (The Environmental Agency)"],"keyword":["CH4","CO2","Drivhusgasser","Emissionsopgørelser","Klima","N2O","UNFCCC"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"denmark s national inventory report 000000002012 emission inventories 000000001990 000000002010 submitted under the united nations framework convention on climate change and the kyoto protocol","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www2.dmu.dk/Pub/SR19.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-089.83-672719","ids":["au-8b440646-6584-4892-bb09-ebcef027022f","ku-0e7fad36-64ae-4481-8412-1167e9c78987","ku-1eab3343-5ee5-4ccd-ad8b-0548442a040d"],"keyword":["CH4","