{"abstract":"Including users in large participatory innovation projects together with professional innovators such as designers, people from marketing, engineers etc puts a strain on the user that might not like to be the focus of attention. With point of departure in two cases, one from business and a student project, the paper illustrates and discusses the use of personas as a mean to get users involved in innovation, address their needs, and at the same time be a platform that gives all participants equal involvement.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Nielsen, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-730199"],"event":{"end":"2012-01-14","place":"Melbourne, au","start":"2012-01-12","title":"PIN-C 2012","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Design Collaboration","Equal Involvement","Participatory Innovation","Personas","User Inclusion"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"acting as someone like me personas in participatory innovation","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Lene-Nielsen-5/publication/228091653_ACTING_AS_SOMEONE_LIKE_ME_-_PERSONAS_IN_PARTICIPATORY_INNOVATION/links/09e414ff06a12bc659000000/ACTING-AS-SOMEONE-LIKE-ME-PERSONAS-IN-PARTICIPATORY-INNOVATION.pdf?_tp=eyJjb250ZXh0Ijp7ImZpcnN0UGFnZSI6InB1YmxpY2F0aW9uIiwicGFnZSI6InB1YmxpY2F0aW9uIn19","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-730199","ids":["itu-e293c2b3-e55b-4a55-8866-47dd9f2747eb"],"keyword":["Design Collaboration","Equal Involvement","Participatory Innovation","Personas","User Inclusion"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C44ABD11C869FB350715A8E1468516FD"],"oa_link"