ns D","key":"lundgrenjenspau","last":"Lundgren","locid":"af310f7a-c49b-4381-bcb4-cf56e3fd80d8","name":"Lundgren, Jens","name_org":"Lundgren, Jens D","orcid":"0000-0001-8901-7850","rank":25,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["22411933"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1136/bmjopen-2011-000635","issn":["20446055"],"issue":"2","journal":"BMJ Open","publisher":"BMJ Publishing Group","status":"p","title":"BMJ Open","volume":"2"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84860476528"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-209c44aa-4593-41ba-ba37-0f998808238b","ku-7ec439f3-eb62-400e-99de-56db03625aa2"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Kidney failure related to broad-spectrum antibiotics in critically ill patients : secondary end point results from a 1200 patient randomised trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-091.43-014978","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Abstract Pulmonary hypertension (PH) worsens the prognosis in chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD). The diagnosis of PH is established by right heart catheterisation (RHC), while echocardiography can be used for screening. We aimed to asses the outcome of echocardiographic screening for PH in a group of stable COPD out-patients, and to evaluate NT-proBNP as a first line screening tool. Criteria for PH on echocardiography were a tricuspid regurgitation pressure gradient > 40 mmHg, a tricuspid annular plane systolic excursion <1.8 cm or right ventricular dilatation. Positively screened patients were asked to undergo RHC. Results (Mean ± SEM): 16 of 117 patients (14%) had PH on echocardiography. They had a higher mortality (hazard ratio for death: 2.7 ± 1.3, p = 0.037) and lower six minute walk test (224 ± 33 vs. 339 ± 15, p = 0.006). NT-proBNP below 95 ng/l excluded PH on echocardiography with a negative predictive value of 100 (95% CI: 89-100%). RHC was obtained in six patients screened positive. In three of these, PH was not confirmed. Conclusions: Signs of PH on echocardiography as defined here was found in 14% and had prognostic significance in COPD. A value of NT-proBNP less than 95 ng/l may be used to exclude signs of PH.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Andersen, Charlotte Uggerhøj","Mellemkjær, Søren","Nielsen-Kudsk, Jens Erik","Sønderskov, Lene D","Laursen, Britt Elmedal","Simonsen, Ulf","Hilberg, Ole"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-245174"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"echocardiographic screening for pulmonary hypertension in stable copd out patients and nt probnp as a rule out test","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/15412555.2012.695818","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-245174","identifier":[{"id":"22708731","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84867082186","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-cabd4ea7-c0a9-40a4-be30-041c53e1bab2"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C18B41478A445C57D1E24C036BDBB17C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/15412555.2012.695818","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Biomedicine, Department of Biomedicine - Pharmacology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte U","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"d9de514e-16a5-468a-96aa-7dce1995a898","name":"Andersen, Charlotte Uggerhøj","name_org":"Andersen, Charlotte U","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"mellemkjærpau","last":"Mellemkjær","locid":"ce0064d1-3a0f-481d-8375-fd1d65bdd7dc","name":"Mellemkjær, Søren","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens E","key":"nielsenkudskpau","last":"Nielsen-Kudsk","locid":"8629b763-e23e-41d9-ac4f-61579d19565e","name":"Nielsen-Kudsk, Jens Erik","name_org":"Nielsen-Kudsk, Jens E","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene D","key":"sønderskovpau","last":"Sønderskov","name":"Sønderskov, Lene D","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Britt E","key":"laursenpau","last":"Laursen","locid":"2148c875-86ab-432a-8b2c-1dbd33b665e6","name":"Laursen, Britt Elmedal","name_org":"Laursen, Britt E","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ulf","key":"simonsenpau","last":"Simonsen","locid":"eed8d0f5-bdc4-462e-9638-d2e314b2363c","name":"Simonsen, Ulf","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole","key":"hilbergpau","last":"Hilberg","locid":"4cec668c-4042-4069-9e37-b09fe84ed3b1","name":"Hilberg, Ole","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["22708731"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3109/15412555.2012.695818","issn":["15412555","15412563"],"issn_org":["15412555"],"journal":"COPD","pages":"505","publisher":"Taylor and Francis Ltd.","status":"p","title":"COPD","title_org":"C O P D"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84867082186"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-cabd4ea7-c0a9-40a4-be30-041c53e1bab2"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Echocardiographic screening for pulmonary hypertension in stable COPD out-patients and NT-proBNP as a rule-out test","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-245174","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Baggrunden for projektet er, at der i udkantskommunerne er en stor andel af unge, der ikke har uddannelse over grundskolen. Samtidig forventes der en markant mangel på arbejdskraft i løbet af nogle år bl.a. på grund af de store årganges tilbagetrækning fra arbejdsmarkedet. I forlængelse af disse udfordringer har projektet til formål at udvikle og afprøve nye metoder til rekruttering, motivering og fastholdelse af unge i ungdomsuddannelserne – med særligt fokus på unges identitetsprocesser, deres behov for faglige og sociale fællesskaber og relationer samt frafald og overgange i uddannelsessystemerne. Projektet skal arbejde med samspillet mellem unges liv uden for skolen og den undervisning og det faglige og sociale miljø, de oplever i erhvervsuddannelserne.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Wulf-Andersen, Trine Østergaard","Larsen, Lene","Mogensen, Kevin","Thingstrup, Signe Hvid","Hjort-Madsen, Peder","Baagøe Nielsen, Steen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-386410"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC","DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"unge uddannelse og ungdomsliv i sjællandske udkantsområder","src":["kp"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.academia.edu/2422234/Unge_uddannelse_og_ungdomsliv_i_sj%C3%A6llandske_udkantsomr%C3%A5der","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-386410","ids":["kp-2a5e1c94-ab85-44d1-a1bd-6d97e6dee726"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-6067795F8052C59C2C7404B494649DFF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.academia.edu/2422234/Unge_uddannelse_og_ungdomsliv_i_sj%C3%A6ll