{"abstract":"The objective of this study was to evaluate the clinical outcome of tuberculosis (TB) with regards to epidemiology, symptoms, delay, diagnostics, use of HIV-test, treatment, treatment outcome and mortality in the North Jutland Region from 2000 through 2008.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Andersen, Rosa M Ø","Bjørn-Præst, Simon O","Oren Gradel, Kim","Nielsen, Carl","Nielsen, Henrik Ib"],"cuid":["S02-082.86-015340"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Denmark","Female","HIV Infections","Humans","Male","Mycobacterium tuberculosis","Retrospective Studies","Treatment Outcome","Tuberculosis"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"epidemiology diagnostic delay and outcome of tuberculosis in north jutland denmark","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/79952378998","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-082.86-015340","identifier":[{"id":"79952378998","type":"scopus"},{"id":"21371406","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-25c817c9-ebe0-4e33-91d7-de98de9034eb","sdu-03e0cd61-7e20-43f0-9a6e-68ac5f09618c"],"keyword":["Denmark","Female","HIV Infections","Humans","Male","Mycobacterium tuberculosis","Retrospective Studies","Treatment Outcome","Tuberculosis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-F5195DEC7CE193A2440ABB906A67266E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Clinical Epidemiology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Faculty of Health Sciences, Lungemedicinsk Afdeling, AAL"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Rosa M Ø","key":"andersenrosamøpau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Rosa M Ø","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene Rosa-Marie","key":"andersenlenerosamariepau","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Lene Rosa-Marie","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Simon O","key":"bjørnpræstsimonopau","last":"Bjørn-Præst","name":"Bjørn-Præst, Simon O","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kim O","key":"gradelkimorenpau","last":"Gradel","locid":"1d28d7bc-60bb-46f5-8143-bc6508387a8f","name":"Gradel, Kim Oren","name_org":"Gradel, Kim O","orcid":"0000-0002-5611-2031","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Kim","key":"orengradelkimpau","last":"Oren Gradel","name":"Oren Gradel, Kim","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Carl","key":"nielsencarlpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"316bbebe-2fb6-45d9-b294-55409097f9c8","name":"Nielsen, Carl","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Ib","key":"nielsenhenrikibpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"47acf75b-3189-481a-80ba-7342220b7d32","name":"Nielsen, Henrik Ib","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["21371406"],"pub":{"issn":["09078916","22451919"],"issn_org":["16039629"],"issue":"3","journal":"Danish Medical Journal","publisher":"Almindelige Danske Lægeforening","status":"p","title":"Danish Medical Journal","title_org":"Danish Medical Bulletin (Online)","volume":"58"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-79952378998"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-25c817c9-ebe0-4e33-91d7-de98de9034eb","sdu-03e0cd61-7e20-43f0-9a6e-68ac5f09618c"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Epidemiology, diagnostic delay and outcome of tuberculosis in North Jutland, Denmark","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-082.86-015340","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Human exonuclease 1 (hEXO1) is implicated in DNA metabolism, including replication, recombination and repair, substantiated by its interactions with PCNA, DNA helicases BLM and WRN, and several DNA mismatch repair (MMR) proteins. We investigated the sub-nuclear localization of hEXO1 during S-phase progression and in response to laser-induced DNA double strand breaks (DSBs). We show that hEXO1 and PCNA co-localize in replication foci. This apparent interaction is sustained throughout S-phase. We also demonstrate that hEXO1 is rapidly recruited to DNA DSBs. We have identified a PCNA interacting protein (PIP-box) region on hEXO1 located in its COOH-terminal ((788)QIKLNELW(795)). This motif is essential for PCNA binding and co-localization during S-phase. Recruitment of hEXO1 to DNA DSB sites is dependent on the MMR protein hMLH1. We show that two distinct hMLH1 interaction regions of hEXO1 (residues 390-490 and 787-846) are required to direct the protein to the DNA damage site. Our results reveal that protein domains in hEXO1 in conjunction with specific protein interactions control bi-directional routing of hEXO1 between on-going DNA replication and repair processes in living cells.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Liberti, Sascha E.","Andersen, Sofie Dabros","Wang, Jing","May, Alfred","Miron, Simona","Perderiset, Mylene","Keijzers, Guido","Nielsen, Finn Cilius","Charbonnier, Jean-Baptiste","Bohr, Vilhelm A.","Rasmussen, Lene Juel"],"cuid":["S02-089.70-039794"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["DNA Mismatch Repair","Double strand break","PCNA"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"bi directional routing of dna mismatch repair protein human exonuclease 000000000001 to replication foci and dna double strand breaks","src":["ku","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.dnarep.2010.09.023","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-089.70-039794","identifier":[{"id":"78650419915","type":"scopus"},{"id":"20970388","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC4586255","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-03c768d0-556b-48ed-a2fb-6f1b6dce22e1","ruc-01cd3289-465b-4cd7-8fd3-c482570b7128"],"keyword":["DNA mismatch repair","Double strand break","PCNA","Replication foci","hEXO1"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-EDEC6F7A1FB9EC782FF51FD719748A7E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.dnarep.2010.09.023","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Cellular and Molecular Medicine, Molecular Aging Program"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, The Department of Science, Systems and Models"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University H