{"abstract":"Hypersensitivity pneumonitis is a rare interstitial lung disease and very few data regarding frequency, treatment and outcome exist for children. Children identified with hypersensitivity pneumonia from a Danish national cohort with diffuse interstitial lung disease form the basis of this study focused on disease frequency, treatment, and functional outcome.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Buchvald, Frederik","Petersen, Bodil Laub","Damgaard, Karen","Deterding, Robin","Langston, Claire","Fan, Leland L","Deutsch, Gail H","Dishop, Megan K","Kristensen, Lene Agergaard","Nielsen, Kim G"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-498321"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"frequency treatment and functional outcome in children with hypersensitivity pneumonitis","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ppul.21479","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-498321","identifier":[{"id":"80054994534","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-af9a45f1-2f23-4f50-9e5a-9fe8403ce5c7"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-60FBD5B66FE4702B3290AC3D22F82691"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ppul.21479","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":1,"key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Section of Diagnostic Sciences"],"nora_code":"D