],"issue":"2","journal":"Klinisk Sygepleje","pages":"56-65","publisher":"Scandinavian University Press","status":"p","title":"Klinisk Sygepleje","volume":"25"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-eda115ad-6f31-43e6-8c3a-6c1a6e99e40c"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Personlige motiver for at deltage i gruppeterapeutisk behandling","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-641298","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Study objectives: The aim of this study was to evaluate the medication review service performed by clinical pharmacists at the Regional Hospital Horsens, Brædstrup and Odder (RHHBO), Denmark, including presentation of number and type, and acceptance rate, of recommendations made during the study period at the hospital wards involved. Methods: Patients admitted to wards receiving the medication review service from 1 February to 31 May 2008 were included in the study. Patients were identified via the electronic charts, and the medication reviews were performed using the electronic medication list of admitted patients. The prescribed medications were matched to accessible information on the patient's usual medication regimen. The medication reviews were documented in the electronic charts; these were followed up a few days later for documentation of which medical action had been performed as a result of the recommendations. Results: Medication reviews were performed for 2,405 patients, and recommendations were made for 43% (range 29-54%) of the patients (1,512 recommendations in total). The evaluation showed that the medication review service is gradually being implemented at the wards at RHHBO. Recommendations varied, particularly between admitting and non-admitting wards, where medication reconciliation was the most frequent service at admitting wards, while the most frequent recommendations made at non-admitting wards were related to side effects and interactions. More than half (53%) of the recommendations were accepted by the physicians. Conclusion: The medication review service was generally well implemented at the wards, however, room for improvement exists, e.g. regarding the physicians' action on the recommendations.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Kjeldsen, Lene Juel","Olesen, Charlotte","Truelshøj, Tania Holtum","Brondgaard Nielsen, Lilian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-755485"],"filters":{"added":"2024-09","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"quality assurance of medical treatment an approach by danish clinical pharmacists","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/79959194107","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-755485","identifier":[{"id":"79959194107","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-9e50680e-c295-4825-a53b-c28f13a170b3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-11D45B88BA9A978C3FBEF392D61A60FB"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, IRS - Hospital Sønderjylland, Research Unit of Hospital Pharmacy (Aabenraa)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Amgros"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Regio